sers/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJJones66/BrainDrive-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/commits/154e12fdad6d55a8e551f4cb55ab348555de49e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-16T16:57:23Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-16T16:57:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: comprehensive documentation update and service runtime guide (#36)\n\n* docs: add comprehensive service runtime management documentation\n\nCreate service-runtime-requirements.md with complete technical guide covering:\n- Field reference for required_services_runtime\n- Installation flow, startup/shutdown lifecycle\n- Environment variable integration with settings\n- Database schema, troubleshooting, best practices\n- Real examples from lifecycle_manager.py\n\nUpdate OWNERS-MANUAL.md:\n- Fix three-tier architecture diagram\n- Document automatic service management\n- Remove manual installation steps\n- Update developer guide with accurate local dev methods\n- Add service runtime requirements section\n- Clarify standalone mode makes real API calls\n\nUpdate docs/README.md and FOR-AI-CODING-AGENTS.md:\n- Reference new service-runtime-requirements.md guide\n- Add Backend Service Runtime Management section\n- Document testing commands and file references\n\n* docs: update owner''s manual with accurate plugin usage and configuration\n\nUpdate prerequisites, installation, and configuration sections:\n- Change prerequisites to optional service health check after plugin install\n- Fix installation steps with detailed UI workflow\n- Update retrieved context description (below response, not above)\n- Remove streaming toggle references (always on by default)\n- Update evaluation feature workflow (model, persona, collection selection)\n- Replace backend configuration with plugin settings explanation\n- Explain why settings are in plugin (separate Docker containers)\n- Document all settings sections (LLM, Embedding, Contextual, Evaluation)\n- Update monitoring section (automatic health checks, Docker logs)\n- Remove backup section (managed by backend service)\n- Remove backend service updates section\n- Add context window troubleshooting with community link\n\n* docs: refine owner''s manual with accurate technical details\n\nConfiguration and monitoring improvements:\n- Reduce health check mentions (now only 2 total)\n- Update all base URL examples to host.docker.internal:11434 (Docker context)\n- Clarify Ollama-only support with future enhancement notes\n- Add critical warning to update settings after installation\n- Update evaluation model example to gpt-4o-mini\n- Explain model dropdown pulls from BrainDrive-Core\n\nContext window troubleshooting enhancements:\n- Add detailed token allocation breakdown (system, history, context, buffer)\n- Replace solution link with discussion reference\n- Add future RAG optimizations section:\n  - Chunk size reduction\n  - Dynamic chunk retrieval\n  - Reverse chunk ordering\n  - Context normalization\n  - Customizable token budgets\n\nService monitoring simplification:\n- Consolidate health check information\n- Emphasize automatic UI monitoring\n- Move manual curl commands to optional section\n\n* docs: complete owner''s manual rewrite for user-friendly readability\n\nComplete restructure with progressive complexity approach:\n\nTable of Contents reorganized into 3 sections:\n- Getting Started (new users start here)\n- Using the Plugin (daily usage)\n- Configuration & Management (when needed)\n- For Technical Users (advanced topics last)\n\nMajor content improvements:\n- Plain English explanations throughout\n- Step-by-step walkthroughs with real examples\n- ''Your First Chat'' complete walkthrough\n- Problem/solution format troubleshooting\n- Visual cues (✅ DO / ❌ DON''T examples)\n- Progressive disclosure (simple → complex)\n\nSimplified language:\n- Removed technical jargon in user sections\n- Added ''What is this?'' introduction\n- Explained concepts before using technical terms\n- Used analogies (collections = folders)\n\nBetter organization:\n- Prerequisites upfront with download links\n- Settings explained with context (why needed)\n- Architecture moved to end (technical users only)\n- Developer info separated from user guide\n\nAccurate technical flow:\n- BrainDrive-Core generates answers (not Ollama directly)\n- Chat With Docs returns context chunks\n- Clarified model list comes from all configured providers\n\nKept old version as OWNERS-MANUAL-OLD.md for reference\n\n* docs: fix owner''s manual date, TOC, and critical details\n\nFix metadata and formatting:\n- Update last updated date to November 16, 2025 (not January)\n- Format table of contents as proper markdown with ### headers\n\nCorrect settings details:\n- Update all OpenAI model references to gpt-5-mini (from constants.ts)\n- Clarify Save & Restart vs Save Settings buttons\n- Explain Save & Restart restarts Docker containers with new env vars\n- Save Settings only saves to DB, requires BrainDrive restart\n\nAdd internal documentation links:\n- Link to FOR-AI-CODING-AGENTS.md\n- Link to service-runtime-requirements.md\n- Link to plugin-requirements.md\n- Link to docs/README.md\n- All links use relative paths for easy navigation\n\n* docs: update remaining gpt-4o-mini reference to gpt-5-mini\n\nChange evaluation model recommendation at line 124 to match constants.ts default value.\n\n* docs: cleanup owner''s manual with latest models and tips\n\nUpdates and improvements:\n- Remove ''automatic'' from evaluation settings description\n- Update BrainDrive-Core restart instructions with proper command\n- Add persona context window override solution for context size issues\n- Add tip about DOCX/Markdown processing faster than PDF\n- Update model recommendations with November 2025 research:\n  * Organized by RAM: 8GB, 16GB, 32GB+ devices\n  * Added Gemma 3 models (multimodal, 128K context)\n  * Added Qwen 2.5 and DeepSeek-R1 models\n  * Added Phi-4 for edge devices\n  * Included performance metrics and use cases\n- Add tip: run ''ollama show <model>'' to check context length\n\n* chore: remove outdated docs, add PowerShell build script\n\nCleanup and improvements:\n- Remove COMPOUNDING_ENGINEERING_SETUP.md (redundant with docs/AI-AGENT-GUIDE.md)\n- Remove AI_AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md (redundant with FOR-AI-CODING-AGENTS.md)\n- Add build.ps1 for Windows PowerShell users\n- Update README with build script documentation:\n  * Explain what build scripts do\n  * Show usage for both Linux/Mac and Windows\n  * Clarify post-build steps\n\n* fix: correct plugin name in build scripts\n\nUpdate BrainDriveChat to BrainDriveChatWithDocs in both build.sh and build.ps1","tree":{"sha":"1c4fae5b4bac1c32f2ac2ae83c65355da4f62f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJJones66/BrainDrive-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/git/trees/1c4fae5b4bac1c32f2ac2ae83c65355da4f62f6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJJones66/BrainDrive-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/git/commits/154e12fdad6d55a8e551f4cb55ab348555de49e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c4fae5b4bac1c32f2ac2ae83c65355da4f62f6a\nparent 9ff17350df282fa5f58f00ef42490e1c855a1db2\nauthor Beck Bekmyradov <47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com> 1763312243 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763312243 +0400\n\ndocs: comprehensive documentation update and service runtime guide (#36)\n\n* docs: add comprehensive service runtime management documentation\n\nCreate service-runtime-requirements.md with complete technical guide covering:\n- Field reference for required_services_runtime\n- Installation flow, startup/shutdown lifecycle\n- Environment variable integration with settings\n- Database schema, troubleshooting, best practices\n- Real examples from lifecycle_manager.py\n\nUpdate OWNERS-MANUAL.md:\n- Fix three-tier architecture diagram\n- Document automatic service management\n- Remove manual installation steps\n- Update developer guide with accurate local dev methods\n- Add service runtime requirements section\n- Clarify standalone mode makes real API calls\n\nUpdate docs/README.md and FOR-AI-CODING-AGENTS.md:\n- Reference new service-runtime-requirements.md guide\n- Add Backend Service Runtime Management section\n- Document testing commands and file references\n\n* docs: update owner''s manual with accurate plugin usage and configuration\n\nUpdate prerequisites, installation, and configuration sections:\n- Change prerequisites to optional service health check after plugin install\n- Fix installation steps with detailed UI workflow\n- Update retrieved context description (below response, not above)\n- Remove streaming toggle references (always on by default)\n- Update evaluation feature workflow (model, persona, collection selection)\n- Replace backend configuration with plugin settings explanation\n- Explain why settings are in plugin (separate Docker containers)\n- Document all settings sections (LLM, Embedding, Contextual, Evaluation)\n- Update monitoring section (automatic health checks, Docker logs)\n- Remove backup section (managed by backend service)\n- Remove backend service updates section\n- Add context window troubleshooting with community link\n\n* docs: refine owner''s manual with accurate technical details\n\nConfiguration and monitoring improvements:\n- Reduce health check mentions (now only 2 total)\n- Update all base URL examples to host.docker.internal:11434 (Docker context)\n- Clarify Ollama-only support with future enhancement notes\n- Add critical warning to update settings after installation\n- Update evaluation model example to gpt-4o-mini\n- Explain model dropdown pulls from BrainDrive-Core\n\nContext window troubleshooting enhancements:\n- Add detailed token allocation breakdown (system, history, context, buffer)\n- Replace solution link with discussion reference\n- Add future RAG optimizations section:\n  - Chunk size reduction\n  - Dynamic chunk retrieval\n  - Reverse chunk ordering\n  - Context normalization\n  - Customizable token budgets\n\nService monitoring simplification:\n- Consolidate health check information\n- Emphasize automatic UI monitoring\n- Move manual curl commands to optional section\n\n* docs: complete owner''s manual rewrite for user-friendly readability\n\nComplete restructure with progressive complexity approach:\n\nTable of Contents reorganized into 3 sections:\n- Getting Started (new users start here)\n- Using the Plugin (daily usage)\n- Configuration & Management (when needed)\n- For Technical Users (advanced topics last)\n\nMajor content improvements:\n- Plain English explanations throughout\n- Step-by-step walkthroughs with real examples\n- ''Your First Chat'' complete walkthrough\n- Problem/solution format troubleshooting\n- Visual cues (✅ DO / ❌ DON''T examples)\n- Progressive disclosure (simple → complex)\n\nSimplified language:\n- Removed technical jargon in user sections\n- Added ''What is this?'' introduction\n- Explained concepts before using technical terms\n- Used analogies (collections = folders)\n\nBetter organization:\n- Prerequisites upfront with download links\n- Settings explained with context (why needed)\n- Architecture moved to end (technical users only)\n- Developer info separated from user guide\n\nAccurate technical flow:\n- BrainDrive-Core generates answers (not Ollama directly)\n- Chat With Docs returns context chunks\n- Clarified model list comes from all configured providers\n\nKept old version as OWNERS-MANUAL-OLD.md for reference\n\n* docs: fix owner''s manual date, TOC, and critical details\n\nFix metadata and formatting:\n- Update last updated date to November 16, 2025 (not January)\n- Format table of contents as proper markdown with ### headers\n\nCorrect settings details:\n- Update all OpenAI model references to gpt-5-mini (from constants.ts)\n- Clarify Save & Restart vs Save Settings buttons\n- Explain Save & Restart restarts Docker containers with new env vars\n- Save Settings only saves to DB, requires BrainDrive restart\n\nAdd internal documentation links:\n- Link to FOR-AI-CODING-AGENTS.md\n- Link to service-runtime-requirements.md\n- Link to plugin-requirements.md\n- Link to docs/README.md\n- All links use relative paths for easy navigation\n\n* docs: update remaining gpt-4o-mini reference to gpt-5-mini\n\nChange evaluation model recommendation at line 124 to match constants.ts default value.\n\n* docs: cleanup owner''s manual with latest models and tips\n\nUpdates and improvements:\n- Remove ''automatic'' from evaluation settings description\n- Update BrainDrive-Core restart instructions with proper command\n- Add persona context window override solution for context size issues\n- Add tip about DOCX/Markdown processing faster than PDF\n- Update model recommendations with November 2025 research:\n  * Organized by RAM: 8GB, 16GB, 32GB+ devices\n  * Added Gemma 3 models (multimodal, 128K context)\n  * Added Qwen 2.5 and DeepSeek-R1 models\n  * Added Phi-4 for edge devices\n  * Included performance metrics and use cases\n- Add tip: run ''ollama show <model>'' to check context length\n\n* chore: remove outdated docs, add PowerShell build script\n\nCleanup and improvements:\n- Remove COMPOUNDING_ENGINEERING_SETUP.md (redundant with docs/AI-AGENT-GUIDE.md)\n- Remove AI_AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md (redundant with FOR-AI-CODING-AGENTS.md)\n- Add build.ps1 for Windows PowerShell users\n- Update README with build script documentation:\n  * Explain what build scripts do\n  * Show usage for both Linux/Mac and Windows\n  * Clarify post-build steps\n\n* fix: correct plugin name in build scripts\n\nUpdate BrainDriveChat to BrainDriveChatWithDocs in both build.sh and build.ps1","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpGgJzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1lkQAFNDgPJjTat430Xn+cmE0+H8\nuuYlCE+1pXmqyVzfTd5V341f9MHOQbja+mr49UmvBN6mWKA+k3mvQkCfIIDbph77\n41EyKZceLio5JS5kYR2rCRpwf0kLzigZVMiIa1oCooXtE1TFTzrz0PGmHlrvNTwy\nN2awllucPpKYgkc4Grd8xInHr+Upd7C4yecVjaJ8gpaBjL8ED6FD1XeU379+/h8+\nHc1OnKMCQ+pNfuZuV1cFha4O7QXn3OcHJibWoJul5rXa6Cf2RErOCFmFFte/YAZn\ndB6jCBub7mQ2SQcL6NS5jtEkypnPXqzk2qq61p+5uY2TY5FTtSbD7sxm4I3pMJwP\nUBQsM9gWLO2PjDLsevYGOnCi762nVf0mLiFLnAe/m3qfo0dyI6N9UcOSeIZgOf9K\na9ejR/wqs3eH0MztVEgP/t0YFhOMZv5MUX6rH5VCQfxhe0mYF1vRn/8RWfj93CHe\nnnfCru4lInSIlmmUtwtbnjL8xooPbzjvFpBK/FipJIE90gsUjUyl7HgqbZyx6mPX\nlFRmOEfaCz6JkIngfe0B5bOvA4UGWTCyEraJf9qW4T/c591ZIv5K6aw74iTJZmWm\nPwr8qA54ebixw17vEWNrnrNja0Te4YKC75dvQmSO5+JY6tOqKrJAYRB8Qo25bXnz\nbP5aJm+7pNTyjrvjJDXy\n=c+Rq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-17T13:42:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/