"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJJones66/BrainDrive-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/commits/d94f3c63f36c21222def96c12f62997ebd8a5fa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-14T11:40:35Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-14T11:40:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: replace Tailwind dark mode with CSS variables for theming (#33)\n\n* refactor: replace Tailwind dark classes with CSS variables\n\nRemove Tailwind @variant dark directive from ChatWithDocs.css since we''re using CSS variable-based theming instead.\n\nAdd custom CSS classes in EvaluationView.css:\n- eval-stats-card, eval-stats-label, eval-stats-value for stats cards\n- eval-table-row, eval-table-cell for tables\n- eval-input for input fields\n- eval-tab, eval-filter-btn for tabs and filters\n- eval-result-item, eval-result-header for result items\n\nReplace all Tailwind dark: classes with CSS variable classes in:\n- StatsCards, RunsTable, FilterControls, StatusFilter\n- EvaluationTabs, ResultItem, ResultsSummary\n- EvaluationViewShell, ServiceStatusDetails\n\nFollow official BrainDrive plugin theming pattern using CSS variables that adapt to .dark-theme class.\n\nVerified dark/light mode switching works correctly using Playwright browser testing.\n\n* refactor: replace remaining Tailwind dark classes in core components\n\nAdd CSS classes for common plugin components in BrainDriveChat.components.css:\n- plugin-header-bg, plugin-header-title, plugin-header-button\n- collection-list-item, collection-item-title, collection-item-description, collection-item-meta\n- collection-list-bg, collection-list-divider\n- plugin-content-bg\n\nReplace Tailwind dark: classes with CSS variable classes in:\n- BrainDriveChatWithDocs.tsx - main plugin content\n- PluginHeader.tsx - header buttons and titles\n- CollectionsList.tsx - list/grid items, backgrounds\n- CollectionViewShell.tsx - section titles, new collection button\n\nAll components now use CSS variables that adapt to theme changes.\n\n* fix: CollectionForm theme support via CSS variables\n\nReplace hardcoded light theme classes in CollectionForm with CSS variable-based classes.\n\nChanges:\n- bg-white → collection-form-container\n- text-gray-700 labels → collection-form-label\n- border-gray-300 inputs → collection-form-input\n- bg-gray-300 cancel btn → collection-form-button-cancel\n- bg-blue-600 create btn → CSS variable --button-primary-bg\n\nAll inputs, labels, buttons now adapt to dark/light theme automatically.\n\n* build: rebuild dist after theme fixes\n\nRebuild production bundle with all CSS variable-based theming changes.","tree":{"sha":"4da63ca41d4828f8c2193f7eb4b47a5f3671384a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJJones66/BrainDrive-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/git/trees/4da63ca41d4828f8c2193f7eb4b47a5f3671384a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJJones66/BrainDrive-Chat-With-Docs-Plugin/git/commits/d94f3c63f36c21222def96c12f62997ebd8a5fa8","verification":{"payload":"tree 4da63ca41d4828f8c2193f7eb4b47a5f3671384a\nparent 46a5318dcb70163549e3cfd5b5236f4997a1074d\nauthor Beck Bekmyradov <47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com> 1763120435 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763120435 +0400\n\nfix: replace Tailwind dark mode with CSS variables for theming (#33)\n\n* refactor: replace Tailwind dark classes with CSS variables\n\nRemove Tailwind @variant dark directive from ChatWithDocs.css since we''re using CSS variable-based theming instead.\n\nAdd custom CSS classes in EvaluationView.css:\n- eval-stats-card, eval-stats-label, eval-stats-value for stats cards\n- eval-table-row, eval-table-cell for tables\n- eval-input for input fields\n- eval-tab, eval-filter-btn for tabs and filters\n- eval-result-item, eval-result-header for result items\n\nReplace all Tailwind dark: classes with CSS variable classes in:\n- StatsCards, RunsTable, FilterControls, StatusFilter\n- EvaluationTabs, ResultItem, ResultsSummary\n- EvaluationViewShell, ServiceStatusDetails\n\nFollow official BrainDrive plugin theming pattern using CSS variables that adapt to .dark-theme class.\n\nVerified dark/light mode switching works correctly using Playwright browser testing.\n\n* refactor: replace remaining Tailwind dark classes in core components\n\nAdd CSS classes for common plugin components in BrainDriveChat.components.css:\n- plugin-header-bg, plugin-header-title, plugin-header-button\n- collection-list-item, collection-item-title, collection-item-description, collection-item-meta\n- collection-list-bg, collection-list-divider\n- plugin-content-bg\n\nReplace Tailwind dark: classes with CSS variable classes in:\n- BrainDriveChatWithDocs.tsx - main plugin content\n- PluginHeader.tsx - header buttons and titles\n- CollectionsList.tsx - list/grid items, backgrounds\n- CollectionViewShell.tsx - section titles, new collection button\n\nAll components now use CSS variables that adapt to theme changes.\n\n* fix: CollectionForm theme support via CSS variables\n\nReplace hardcoded light theme classes in CollectionForm with CSS variable-based classes.\n\nChanges:\n- bg-white → collection-form-container\n- text-gray-700 labels → collection-form-label\n- border-gray-300 inputs → collection-form-input\n- bg-gray-300 cancel btn → collection-form-button-cancel\n- bg-blue-600 create btn → CSS variable --button-primary-bg\n\nAll inputs, labels, buttons now adapt to dark/light theme automatically.\n\n* build: rebuild dist after theme fixes\n\nRebuild production bundle with all CSS variable-based theming changes.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpFxUzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoREQAGZJGMPGuJ3JPttf6RigjT3u\n11GWwf9ZM3E+iDcKWRziZepGgAFDPexYu1+v1YiZIOxaMeuWVFr30kA7Rcg7U1ar\nXEbzWbv3BS2pg9O8JABwXuO9tTxyItpBLoFJaBCMZ4EFSsbpiRKDvjGHgqt4IFOU\neTTHA136V8ceYKmKPPg7BVZonoILZ9eCyFfqaxQWxPKdbms9Rml5fGIEdQSgNyxw\nBA6Lyyif/iLjVIODB5SyMDcqJY22yylFjXuJ8X3cGvlJ