","email":"JDToit@cyclomedia.com","name":"Johannes Du Toit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-17T10:27:14Z","email":"JDToit@cyclomedia.com","name":"Johannes Du Toit"},"message":"feat: Enhance WebLLM and GIS modules with improved functionality and UI\n\n- Updated WebLLM package to utilize @mlc-ai/web-llm for model loading and chat responses.\n- Enhanced GIS module to support SHP/GeoJSON ingestion and added Amsterdam boundary sample.\n- Improved host application to orchestrate auth flow and module selection with better user experience.\n- Added TypeScript typings for new types and improved existing ones.\n- Updated README files across modules for clarity and added instructions for demo users.\n- Enhanced chat UI in WebLLM with message handling and improved styling.\n- Increased max tokens for inference in WebLLM to allow for more comprehensive responses.\n- Added new sample GeoJSON data for better visualization in GIS module.","tree":{"sha":"b915105ddcc1aea114ea02b1076bae5e3ffebc12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jfkproductions/1.Microfrontend/git/trees/b915105ddcc1aea114ea02b1076bae5e3ffebc12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jfkproductions/1.Microfrontend/git/commits/5ac96853b130bcea3582f5d671ded74ca01702ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1781531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfkproductions/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfkproductions/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfkproductions/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfkproductions/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jfkproductions","id":1781531,"login":"jfkproductions","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODE1MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfkproductions/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user