"date":"2026-02-17T03:48:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"improve plugin ui (#75)\n\nThis pull request introduces a comprehensive event logging system and expands admin observability and introspection features in the core platform. It adds persistent event log storage in the database, exposes new GraphQL queries for introspection of registered functions, flows, UI routes, and event logs, and updates the admin UI to surface this metadata. The changes also ensure that plugin-declared roles are auto-created in the database and that core schema migrations run before plugin migrations.","tree":{"sha":"0bbbeb4d32d8487d6c831a193bc83361693da181","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/trees/0bbbeb4d32d8487d6c831a193bc83361693da181"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/commits/234ab76fbdd0d41e8bae47231ba6f4d8426f38f9","verification":{"payload":"tree 0bbbeb4d32d8487d6c831a193bc83361693da181\nparent e998e62fe92359a32d7076e8b6575f7a1ac31c92\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1771300118 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771300118 +0800\n\nimprove plugin ui (#75)\n\nThis pull request introduces a comprehensive event logging system and expands admin observability and introspection features in the core platform. It adds persistent event log storage in the database, exposes new GraphQL queries for introspection of registered functions, flows, UI routes, and event logs, and updates the admin UI to surface this metadata. The changes also ensure that plugin-declared roles are auto-created in the database and that core schema migrations run before plugin migrations.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpk+UWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApS8QAHTArIa1n7jBe7v9l/85w2Lh\n2e7RuuMbta7hIOPyLCdbdXPLG4WCH8D1UThVmsKrle0NkjzMC0A7vgErlOZ8Rr0w\nftqeP50iKqH/htyD9WnxW/1KVOdDwWaL3h4AsYHLOw54S24X9ZvDhHKZ5Gc6oxhT\nb6gga0uLMRXzYDxdgA1M6pf51lUI9rx7/p1XKNmhT9