er_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/commits/6bbf6f155fe25db87dec44a0b667e35bada0377e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-17T02:19:45Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T02:19:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"simplify main (#72)\n\nThis pull request makes significant improvements to how plugin and function package names are handled throughout the codebase, ensuring that full NPM package names—including their scopes—are preserved and used consistently. It also introduces a new scoped function route for serverless functions, updates directory structures for scoped packages, and renames \"ETL\" to \"Replication\" in the admin UI for clarity.","tree":{"sha":"0c3134a155fc993124803ab2dd6cc728cad0ffa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/trees/0c3134a155fc993124803ab2dd6cc728cad0ffa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/commits/6bbf6f155fe25db87dec44a0b667e35bada0377e","verification":{"payload":"tree 0c3134a155fc993124803ab2dd6cc728cad0ffa3\nparent c33d8cf81bc4a9b137ae3553ecc95fe30c5e587b\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1771294785 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771294785 +0800\n\nsimplify main (#72)\n\nThis pull request makes significant improvements to how plugin and function package names are handled throughout the codebase, ensuring that full NPM package names—including their scopes—are preserved and used consistently. It also introduces a new scoped function route for serverless functions, updates directory structures for scoped packages, and renames \"ETL\" to \"Replication\" in the admin UI for clarity.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpk9BBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhcsQAJPijIpPb7TgDR4YfeFmwZPY\nYBxtuNTQHF8+5z78FPVMQpix6u5I88dL2VHOzVgTg//L2FYB