ann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/commits/64b524bc042a6921bd99dc3f339230c2c0f9b2da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T12:57:07Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T12:57:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"add migration page (#70)\n\nThis pull request introduces a major migration in how database schema management is handled for the core service. It removes all SQL schema files and seed scripts from version control, signaling a switch to a new migration system managed by the `trexsql` migration extension. Additionally, it introduces a new GraphQL API for managing and running plugin/database migrations, and makes a minor configuration update to the authentication system.","tree":{"sha":"9de1a5b08c41badd5fe098d642ab5e0ef39586f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/trees/9de1a5b08c41badd5fe098d642ab5e0ef39586f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/commits/64b524bc042a6921bd99dc3f339230c2c0f9b2da","verification":{"payload":"tree 9de1a5b08c41badd5fe098d642ab5e0ef39586f0\nparent 6ce439186c33354aec7b97b022d9eb40fabddcac\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.