//api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/commits/0a693db4d251b382962b3d0c470210b3bd6223f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T09:25:18Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T09:25:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"add core pkg (#65)\n\nThis pull request introduces a comprehensive set of changes focused on improving the authentication, authorization, and database management capabilities of the project, especially for Postgres/PostGraphile environments. It adds a modular schema for user authentication, role-based access control, row-level security, SSO provider management, and external database connection handling. Additionally, it includes supporting Docker and Node.js configuration updates to streamline development and deployment.","tree":{"sha":"4c5bc58fbab0ae62d75a2589112bf165ab4c8948","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/trees/4c5bc58fbab0ae62d75a2589112bf165ab4c8948"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/commits/0a693db4d251b382962b3d0c470210b3bd6223f2","verification":{"payload"