st_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/commits/b18cbbfbcc401acb2903972a1e72a250a629a76d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T04:09:56Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T04:09:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor trexsql (#66)\n\nThis pull request updates the project to rename several core extensions and their associated build, test, and CI infrastructure. The main changes are the renaming of the \"swarm\" extension to \"db\", \"circe\" to \"atlas\", and \"llama\" to \"ai\" throughout the codebase, including build scripts, test jobs, documentation, and submodule paths. These updates ensure consistency and clarity in naming conventions across the project.","tree":{"sha":"27247afd035617600fa884209c3db1bcb81c15ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/trees/27247afd035617600fa884209c3db1bcb81c15ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/commits/b18cbbfbcc401acb2903972a1e72a250a629a76d","verification":{"payload":"tree 27247afd035617600fa884209c3db1bcb81c15ab\nparent f1c007714265bd80eb7dc5de9ce2553794040b21\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1771214996 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771214996 +0800\n\nrefactor trexsq