rs the loading of the native library until it is actually needed, which can help avoid issues at compile time and improve initialization performance. Additionally, the pull request updates all usages of the engine instance to use this new accessor. There is also a minor update to the GitHub Actions workflow for plugin CI to specify the Ubuntu 24.04 runner for the bao extension.","tree":{"sha":"e0ec8086f916ddf64998156c249f5c048de89ce7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/trees/e0ec8086f916ddf64998156c249f5c048de89ce7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/commits/4739ea2ab7abeb202d8f857ceb8fe08c18dd7cbb","verification":{"payload":"tree e0ec8086f916ddf64998156c249f5c048de89ce7\nparent 14516e3b2f683c8b9d4f6a7b311dd2e18864caac\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1771116181 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771116181 +0800\n\nchange ci runner (#63)\n\nThis pull request improves the way the native TrexEngine JNA instance is accessed in the ext/bao/java/src/trexsql/native.clj file by introducing a lazy accessor function. This change defers the loading of the native library until it is actually needed, which can help avoid issues at compile time and improve initialization performance. Additionally, the pull request updates all usages of the engine instance to use this new accessor. There is also a minor update to the GitHub Actions workflow for plugin CI to specify the Ubuntu 24.04 runner for the bao extension.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpkRaVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeycQAIjzVd1YlhLpH17Kkk4k2FG+\ngriwmjSCEb4fjc5vjynQXz4tbO8HctEHYfLsoHmby+e79ncU05ca82ZHsIYRlkFT\nil38Kiy4/R14t0CC+3T6IMIC7iiAQn1mGt00/zNImh5tO+TvB0P5I/oTGZS73SXN\nu0O7CeC1pnBkrPk8VeKVD+erlBdW0goJRORZhQTU4S4ye3Ba70NtyCqHAQnLF0Mt\nDyWuJkthZ4tRWjiMgz+5cpD4/a1Huh+IGhaVikUfBQw8bV9rdBePV0tL3oFeBmZ8\nF3hf1bNJiRySRR2/ISW+7lxx0Rt5h9phoj+Fzo+ULJmFqocUDU0A+T/N5hOhafsT\nJs+S/PSYF2RE3hU+