or":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/commits/14516e3b2f683c8b9d4f6a7b311dd2e18864caac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-14T15:41:46Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-14T15:41:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"switch bao to trexsql-rs (#62)\n\nThis pull request migrates TrexSQL''s Java integration from a JDBC-based approach to a native Rust-backed C API, accessed via JNA. The changes introduce a new native library (`libtrexsql_engine.so`), update build workflows to bundle and use it, and refactor the Java and Clojure code to use native pointers and APIs. The result is improved performance and compatibility, and a more direct integration with TrexSQL''s Rust core.","tree":{"sha":"d0f0f5c9b07ebc95a031eded5ba638502d743e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/trees/d0f0f5c9b07ebc95a031eded5ba638502d743e51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/commits/14516e3b2f683c8b9d4f6a7b311dd2e18864caac","verification":{"payload":"tree d0f0f5c9b07ebc95a031eded5ba638502d743e51\nparent d258b2f8ea578bfc397413cfb19b0ac311c3cad1\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1771083706 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771083706 +0800\n\nswitch bao to trexsql-rs (#62)\n\nThis pull request migrates TrexSQL''s Java integration from a JDBC-based approach to a native Rust-backed C API, accessed via JNA. The changes introduce a new native library (`libtrexsql_engine.so`), update build workflows to bundle and use it, and refactor the Java and Clojure code to use native pointers and APIs. The result is improved performance and compatibility, and a more direct integration with TrexSQL''s Rust core.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpkJe7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALSYQAF3tDqxFMoYEyznUmJoCRCvA\nLbaxwwS0apsXCzgVcJYbLZFJGxy7AFPRl9RmWLLafa+k9W2cpXntZ6K0hMf+KFCT\nH+Fyg1qP6Jj+ZazYpvoB01JqjtnnGwADH+zsXSMhCz5nkH6ggeDZYFZ/ANI273YO\nrAJAVB9MOvO8jlmWTBXF5J2l49ZV8aRLr/13ghTAcHjImbUhJUJ6eStctnsQcDc5\nD9n/ZuqM3k6Ho6vZyBG6iheSQr216Q1TIoY+k8sGdlfzGzpbdB34t31bMLVwgbW4\n++OmRilt+fV/EJC+Gsgn8wtvnyVZqhEexOVQyCjG4uA8o5Huo7Gp+03igJ3oymsZ\nuDffNHMCEzPE1/Qm3LCwJmLtL8WlJXr/aMztjh+oMSH1PJiWadUczkBAuL02s5Vo\nMhce0FBScDj5a7oX4OPLksUjHOQaszLPsj4PLNI2+17th3fc5/6Z6GaElGDVqD9p\nEj63lo4xQpuLJ5yrHCv8keFcocUghhY9Rrshj84p6OoqugmJG6hnY0lv432cP3Jo\njAXgz1EhgqwYWe+5ybXawVTsAntHfKnja1+xBy1WG2esBE1eCT8gmMgwzDAoTGSt\naGrscu78wpXbaZTLMWt5Qnom1BcEwPQDgnwCIyydwh2tm9i8fPUPV36MUkP3U8ga\nO0oJyOd+KdT58yauqY6e\n=nxN8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-14T15:41:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_