updated to match the new DuckDB/trexsql baseline.","tree":{"sha":"6dec22fd6690dfe271626100077e625de08cf852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/trees/6dec22fd6690dfe271626100077e625de08cf852"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p-hoffmann/trexsql-ext/git/commits/770ce5f34f7eb65d3fa436dc4a975863ef8a3a0e","verification":{"payload":"tree 6dec22fd6690dfe271626100077e625de08cf852\nparent ca999bbbdc6e457cb01d6766d5865cdb378f0f16\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1771053666 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771053666 +0800\n\nupdate trexsql to 1.4.4 (#59)\n\nThis pull request upgrades the project and its extensions to use the newer `v1.4.4-trex` release of `trexsql-rs` and its DuckDB fork, replacing previous references to older versions (primarily `v1.4.0-trex` and `1.3.2`). The update also synchronizes dependencies in Rust crates, Dockerfiles, and CI workflows, and introduces additional symlinks for compatibility. Several related dependencies (such as `arrow`, `pgwire`, and others) are also updated to match the new DuckDB/trexsql baseline.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpkCJiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyNIQAKYDD4sbYxMnj9HV+fju5XuE\nnYsCcdqu7j1hTb0dKtQAlH6nAj8Sbvxza6RFBAVSQmNzHRb6CTQn9jmbyXzL0xBn\nKkOt69JmkpKJJfws2ms+Sa+9J0PoNrf1JWR530uLJ0Kog/zZRI8Ndj5uEUlp75xA\nq/3aU4UFd077AWeO/bdw5dAAV1Ao67eiXR9wXJdnCesfhUmII/bVKuqULOLWWmRx\n9RpllvrKL7b36kyCXMHVMlXsV7ZbzI8AdymhVW4yOU9HaX5oK+HtigH+uiLftrV2\nIrxpYO+swtPHkotz/hv8Nt9tBL5zlrWRbnU21AOeSfUQpcPP7ngXql0qoxxUui1f\nMM+dRZ7OSr7bplcMcfnn9R2vUhEEK14ePZTOQHyhgbMqS88GRAxlqwvy8eILZ+aO\no9jsqh5acuY/+NWUDKFDkOgeU5fKabw2l4H0QY9tlQNMNyKIf+kp4kamoHjmmc3D\nkEqLkQ7liZCi6CUl4x8v50XNuijMyH4c6Ki1QADfLPFHLXxqo81ALthSswH02Q2o\nX6tRTDgg0pl6op7asIJ+7OFWVifC2mfxPE1mFfTxLts1FniqFdcuqi5ylOIFlVRs\nYeX5iBp+RgmTM4x5lotnbyT6xQzul5HDOuhgviBGRXOYZb7qqC9CwUmCiMV1LQJh\n+sTTzH4ym+As2d1aVM62\n=VuLE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_