unt":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:15:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(targets): post manual acquire to /targets, not /targets/acquire (#127)\n\nThe Signal K Radar API and mayara-server both take a manual target\nacquire as POST .../radars/<id>/targets. The plugin posted to\n.../targets/acquire, which mayara answers with 405, so every manual\nacquire through the plugin failed. The test pinned the wrong path.\n\nFixes #126\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7c2401e0b63acc83eb3d36e7d5903c88de0216d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/d7c2401e0b63acc83eb3d36e7d5903c88de0216d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/6c2ef1d31ed009dadd60b9611b183a50d9a5fc52","verification":{"payload":"tree d7c2401e0b63acc83eb3d36e7d5903c88de0216d\nparent fb7fd8111feada4f611764f50231121e5fd5b5cf\nauthor Kees Verruijt <kees@verruijt.net> 1791051322 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791051322 +1200\n\nfix(targets): post manual acquire to /targets, not /targets/acquire (#127)\n\nThe Signal K Radar API and mayara-server both take a manual target\nacquire as POST .../radars/<id>/targets. The plugin posted to\n.../targets/acquire, which mayara answers with 405, so every manual\nacquire through the plugin failed. The test pinned the wrong path.\n\nFixes #126\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwUY6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAex4QAD8toVljaVe4P1R8vLezOSG9\n8MAMnX2BMP472iB1B4ls3HuLu5y24wVZ7Ikhsq8kqK4Yryr02LYhL+b0AljpEIoi\nFtiU41Gjzw+Xt++e6D6UlcuWYUUF/UbakDUwIBZ3WRWskRx5HjDY1+KFjloaTvMI\nFqB88kUvlvuXtJecOYQ8wQ/E1UyPp5c2dVsoYqvkQBNjmAPAjsxUBnKfUBhW4lgt\nAqPnPn6WR4pFjPqsEPZW66bZd/jd4Yyd1Gsoz6QOwc7SffOgv3ID8IK91SdphHTv\n8oU6xfPkIcDjdGJtojtvnw5pXfXbZ8yOS7kZiu7L1q3UB2bePurvbAYH1ixAETsh\nzAKzDd98nZZ65tyoRt34fBjKDuLP