ng for them, so\nthis stopped an unwatched radar from ever standing down. Connect on the\nfirst Signal K subscriber to radars/<id> and close after the last one\nleaves, via binaryStreamManager.getClientCount; a server without it\ngets the old always-on behaviour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015VvpP3eXB2WhgD8bwyDWoU\n\n* fix(spokes): let the reconnect backoff outlive a subscriber leaving\n\nA pending reconnect fired even after the last subscriber left, and the\nsubscriber watch reconnected ahead of the backoff. Share the manager\ntype with src/types.ts.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1529eab1ef713c0ce72f02137e40b90fbc2ac5b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/1529eab1ef713c0ce72f02137e40b90fbc2ac5b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/53994e879edbe2b117c3279e13b9fd045c57e905","verification":{"payload":"tree 1529eab1ef713c0ce72f02137e40b90fbc2ac5b0\nparent cd4a0d09c4a0ae704c2913e2a70269801f64d943\nauthor Kees Verruijt <kees@verruijt.net> 1788828185 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788828185 +0900\n\nfix(spokes): hold mayara''s spoke stream only while a client is subscribed (#120)\n\n* fix(spokes): hold mayara''s spoke stream only while a client is subscribed\n\nThe forwarder opened mayara''s spoke stream for every radar at discovery\nand kept it open around the clock. mayara counts every spoke subscriber\nas someone watching the radar and keeps it transmitting for them, so\nthis stopped an unwatched radar from ever standing down. Connect on the\nfirst Signal K subscriber to radars/<id> and close after the last one\nleaves, via binaryStreamManager.getClientCount; a server without it\ngets the old always-on behaviour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015VvpP3eXB2WhgD8bwyDWoU\n\n* fix(spokes): let the reconnect backoff outlive a subscriber leaving\n\nA pending reconnect fired even after the last subscriber left, and the\nsubscriber watch reconnected ahead of the backoff. Share the manager\ntype with src/types.ts.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn1oZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALPkQAHmyGTYRUwWWZ7K9KqBKf2kD\nAfkYVuL5GXFwxcZphuJzllWHgNve0s4Ltn1jAD4Wmzf32hMGjx8IWbyxE8k2jtgt\n8FgWSLCu769QV/YaS+EjH+QQk4qRThRDI6W567SfcmdvI2YgUgYQhRGwsjMR0Xpb\nTq+y0pTqnTsOrGUvu00ZldhJxuaQVDG5wG1pKH9r5Z3PCul0BTIvIYaeUi1pzTfM\nTRI/R1V+4M79u7dOpr7cvxS3JcP8kqFjzfjqzp76u6sm8Bgt9U0krzv7xtv9shzt\nHWgtzJ+lqOIcN7/pWF57YTwvHU3Mnot6Kyh5ZJDfjb+zb27MLp72sab0KMbnWK7r\n4jqoP1075z8GBGBRb+bAVrUC2h6r1aIf3OffUMOdiSMe7j6gbbbQOsFuTTbW2afu\nNxivhIm2+6lvTRRVID8Bpg+IudZ75Xe9/jqRVleWCmwyXF1f2r6LMfEfHI3yEl75\n8rb92a0P5/gGVWhFgcmNQRnhCk/H4yuV/1whvUBYKcf6o4HJWc/KCpVhtujzjtbV\nh82wmSPnYQgkB221gRuwV/Ami6NADtNoLqzg2ZqtCes+i4wTcx2gXhbvOzZyFIdw\nALt58v9PUXrjPd6uYRJspYtBDFm4yHPLKro5zmvU76I9B4h+qNPfxz7rm2CZRXGW\nLkwGkw1BUvxhnr1zGODB\n=Xsqy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T00:43:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-f