//api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/0f248c7ead8de28151e2108d973b074684f098a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T00:37:14Z","email":"kees@verruijt.net","name":"Kees Verruijt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T00:37:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: skip npm 10''s peer resolver, which crashes on the dev tree (#121)\n\nEvery CI job has failed since 2026-09-03 with npm install dying on\n\"Cannot read properties of null (reading ''edgesOut'')\": npm 10''s peer\nresolver loops once vitest 5 exists on the registry, even though this\ntree pins vitest 4. npm 11 is fine. legacy-peer-deps avoids the walk;\nthe tree already lists every peer it needs, builds and tests clean under\nnpm 10.9.4, and .npmrc is never packed so installs from the App Store\nare unchanged.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015VvpP3eXB2WhgD8bwyDWoU\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b865adf189fb287702d1c9b83861f7e7400cb272","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/b865adf189fb287702d1c9b83861f7e7400cb272"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/0f248c7ead8de28151e2108d973b074684f098a6","verification":{"payload":"tree b865adf189fb287702d1c9b83861f7e7400cb272\nparent db7c2613f2666606f28e178a667f1615f48be258\nauthor Kees Verruijt <kees@verruijt.net> 1788827834 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788827834 +0900\n\nci: skip npm 10''s peer resolver, which crashes on the dev tree (#121)\n\nEvery CI job has failed since 2026-09-03 with npm install dying on\n\"Cannot read properties of null (reading ''edgesOut'')\": npm 10''s peer\nresolver loops once vitest 5 exists on the registry, even though this\ntree pins vitest 4. npm 11 is fine. legacy-peer-deps avoids the walk;\nthe tree already lists every peer it needs, builds and tests clean under\nnpm 10.9.4, and .npmrc is never packed so installs from the App Store\nare unchanged.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015VvpP3eXB2WhgD8bwyDWoU\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn1i6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAL8cQABL2eyG9FH85Okfi6NVHURwX\nr5ciiUO1EIoCKfl6zkxrVyWu0FgLhDgzwj1Txuokn0oj1j3dfg7uEqDRfRp0lhRV\nSg+DhhooG5Obb932hFwYVYryK3XX2O+JB3K6Brhv5ng3gybr5dnCPhs2qfbuUvjH\nQqZrVfIDxIPDJ8DDthv0k0G3NjIiait0lYyhyj8Lh0cfM2kNvfKxD8Rnaipt+njs\nqPZSehVhUTfwTtTF8sYkULPplSfI0hqv+kGZD1wBO800wFVcAkc3bSRgFJen9gf0\nv/FJJkvM+7LHHdqzMotWY5ypwxnLhdboWcDL8TWXyPpW+KR0dCOQSObGcs3Wb4Fj\nGftjA/5acA42jgmpx4gAe9Stg/G26yviSRCbVqUpJrNu89sweZMZ+IxzBaJWzXnr\nRGEytYX1x5pjvdsgOrG5QmfjkjPqyZVtGItEgAFLBWIaACtx5FyadJE7vm/BToOu\nPGqwRNKqE5ptDGss/C1icF2QdYH1ra90UtCBnmhVp4ME46n/hI3/7+msKjGEJtTF\nhQZAxgomG31ZPw3OdFP47zs/za2xF1GRSlLBZgaVpGWs09EwnLQTzOXZxV2q50iL\n7h5xlTMvSwZ3wLLmezr5P6ax4Gw+4qgwwJpEhVDXPSP68IOBxl3uEv2WloK6wU+e\nyFkjURBeKfySpX6vAtqK\n=MoJt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T00:37:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commit/0f248c7ead8de28151e2108d973b074684f098a6","node_id":"C_kwDOQqtUNdoAKDBmMjQ4YzdlYWQ4ZGUyODE1MWUyMTA4ZDk3M2IwNzQ2ODRmMDk4YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commit/db7c2613f2666606f28e178a667f1615f48be258","sha":"db7c2613f2666606f28e178a667f1615f48be258","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/db7c2613f2666606f28e178a667f1615f48be258"}],"sha":"0f248c7ead8de28151e2108d973b074684f098a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/0f248c7ead8de28151e2108d973b074684f098a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1608058?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keesverruijt","id":1608058,"login":"keesverruijt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDgwNTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/db7c2613f2666606f28e178a667f1615f48be258/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T06:01:14Z","email":"kees@verruijt.net","name":"Kees Verruijt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T06:01:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(container): name the directory the config mount actually lands on (#118)\n\nsignalkDataMount is documented as the calling plugin''s data dir, but what\narrives is signalk-container''s own -- plugin-config-data/signalk-container/,\nalongside its manifests and caches. Confirmed on a live Pi after 1.5.3.\n\nThe README therefore pointed users at a path that does not exist, and the\ncomment justified the subdirectory with secrets that are not in that\ndirectory: our device and GitHub tokens sit in this plugin''s data dir, which\nis never mounted. The subdirectory is still right, because signalk-container\nshares that directory with every container it manages.","tree":{"sha":"9eab009c67d75ef42cb3d2fe991cdee34e8d75dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/9eab009c67d75ef42cb3d2fe991cdee34e8d75dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/db7c2613f2666606f28e178a667f1615f48be258","verification":{"payload":"tree 9eab009c67d75ef42cb3d2fe991cdee34e8d75dd\nparent 3e77409cf21cd8f73e114fe78a435f45284c48c4\nauthor Kees Verruijt <kees@verruijt.net> 1788069674 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788069674 +0900\n\ndocs(container): name the directory the config mount actually lands on (#118)\n\nsignalkDataMount is documented as the calling plugin''s data dir, but what\narrives is signalk-container''s own -- plugin-config-data/signalk-container/,\nalongside its manifests and caches. Confirmed on a live Pi after 1.5.3.\n\nThe README therefore pointed users at a path that does not exist, and the\ncomment justified the subdirectory with secrets that are not in that\ndirectory: our device and GitHub tokens sit in this plugin''s data dir, which\nis never mounted. The subdirectory is still right, because signalk-container\nshares that directory with every container it manages.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqk8cqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGTgQAIoFmqb/flW+3I7hrmQRZUKl\nX9LsxwwpydjZG3Q6QjMXGpFG5xA2biRo0iE/0h5cIOyRHwbWpH/YnIgsuQ8juTsV\nurIEL20CYJEBKPx/QXmUotdCHQCvUYv7FAIQBeH/sgVHAxeUPQfxAc/5VJMlIoSr\nExXpVcf3oz/7Iy5yyUa5YwDe3rOwxhvm38NxTyb1exH8LYVByPkpkWB4gAALPTrh\naSlNDZs+grXwt1OoF8M0O0JMxe8p70ZpcTujIR/vgo9qdgvO9l2W73WMyoFj/yy7\n2f3/hznydyFAdxWhZ6ZGODI4r/2C0Y3Pj0jRPs1xLD8GDyUlhGPaBpCMHyq+wYzq\nyxfdTPNWwG+u2Q77ERZK1w1cyoCOnjn1q95UvFrKaQq0elR06u0orm0kyg8bVd9q\nU62P1PTQQFcE66TKevyuME7JXwV8OE/6o9Xw99K/yyjUr0n8LYwSJTDRAos08o2b\n41I0H+LrVdOrVsAx1EpdnUzNECHOwrU6v7eJjP8spb0hX4CbyFJbe2nvwqm4RjqX\nJLBMHndkQ/C0WUvYI+ICbjqZlt/9Op0O0wqFMMzMNyag8oPGSTxGJ+oqekvxz+Fx\nDSW2gHQZVRMuxKeGBJnPeB+/1sJwBW1FCxHOGX8M+fezsK5Te4uPqaZZQRimzJNA\nkIeaOYXgJup8Ii/Pnon2\n=DcTW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T06:01:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https