l":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keesverruijt","id":1608058,"login":"keesverruijt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDgwNTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/befd7ccc6969296880b0f845c812ec5f787bd031/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:29:39Z","email":"kees@verruijt.net","name":"Kees Verruijt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:29:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(container): set MAYARA_DEPLOYMENT=signalk-server-plugin (#112)\n\n* feat(container): set MAYARA_DEPLOYMENT=signalk-server-plugin\n\nmayara-server''s telemetry reads MAYARA_DEPLOYMENT to tell \"nobody runs\nGarmin radars\" apart from \"nobody runs Garmin radars *through the\nSignal K plugin*\" -- signalk-server-plugin is the value its own docs\nalready reserve for this. Previously unset, so it fell back to\nmayara''s own embedded/standalone guess.\n\nAlways set now (not conditional on a cached SK token existing), so\nenv is never empty and the config.env assignment below no longer\nneeds the emptiness check that used to guard it.\n\n* test: update env expectations for MAYARA_DEPLOYMENT","tree":{"sha":"8b06f057a73ae1f0477982b0680ea04d3aa11525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/8b06f057a73ae1f0477982b0680ea04d3aa11525"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/befd7ccc6969296880b0f845c812ec5f787bd031","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b06f057a73ae1f0477982b0680ea04d3aa11525\nparent 9b65b46fdb5e2134afabb41624bc5e11c88ed8c2\nauthor Kees Verruijt <kees@verruijt.net> 1787995779 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787995779 +0900\n\nfeat(container): set MAYARA_DEPLOYMENT=signalk-server-plugin (#112)\n\n* feat(container): set MAYARA_DEPLOYMENT=signalk-server-plugin\n\nmayara-server''s telemetry reads MAYARA_DEPLOYMENT to tell \"nobody runs\nGarmin radars\" apart from \"nobody runs Garmin radars *through the\nSignal K plugin*\" -- signalk-server-plugin is the value its own docs\nalready reserve for this. Previously unset, so it fell back to\nmayara''s own embedded/standalone guess.\n\nAlways set now (not conditional on a cached SK token existing), so\nenv is never empty and the config.env assignment below no longer\nneeds the emptiness check that used to guard it.\n\n* test: update env expectations for MAYARA_DEPLOYMENT","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkqaDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKUwQAIYClWvoIsOBjlP67LRnbL/H\nOvEyZ50qnO2hGRf5fo6KCzUL/eWU5wlhxWs70NtddjpH5lFKjNB5EpSGPMk+1LNq\nSHbgsrWXVwShZYUlOfO/3nmOvyXBwRP/jf9LslIZMbhKwoG/95jwZJSas9JP6nFB\nGcwN8dP8/KMC/jqClIhJjzMgVQ17BMWkyId/nsWzukwPDf8GCk9Z653r2kvQVc0t\ngy6ci1nKxOsY+nAceTFew9pXfZExOW7JpI95o7hW2i77smEW7bppUuWhL2WeWisY\n5M1xtqT8Ti9gs4M4N1AUs2yC/lMaSnJUjfPp8ey9DQS4eLxX5IOk2kthhUHhEtK4\n611QQshYME0ajn7tf9ZHvQeC97qcMVqyUeQFzZL146tFbd309rtlho0xmvwqBaBN\nmaRnyNz4xmrKE16WxjosaRIfRpLzCV67UMaQi/dRapZbWe9dxwSZH5dJM02g4sp0\nbZncw5bwPIthwyaTqW00P6Kqy2lGmFNRtATJj3mGbIrUanvByTPIj/TZ2MnlB/sS\n/5akNmEJjCn16V517MNNUnG3uraMqUAH/THz+yAlW8MP6dhbzf8sGRoWFCs+tacR\n4nLLqdW/Gc7n1X4fVXm1m6ZIFQchd+RxotcVOnphliTBS2Fs9db1t7s6J0t7/81x\nY+I+9hL8kxvuGHWMpmD3\n=NYib\n-----END PGP SIGNAT