w","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commit/12eb796939c8c41b168feb7ae511bbdc5f79ee39","node_id":"C_kwDOQqtUNdoAKDEyZWI3OTY5MzljOGM0MWIxNjhmZWI3YWU1MTFiYmRjNWY3OWVlMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commit/f4f2a0c66139b99c6b66f5492b2a6fbfa8c2fcd9","sha":"f4f2a0c66139b99c6b66f5492b2a6fbfa8c2fcd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/f4f2a0c66139b99c6b66f5492b2a6fbfa8c2fcd9"}],"sha":"12eb796939c8c41b168feb7ae511bbdc5f79ee39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/12eb796939c8c41b168feb7ae511bbdc5f79ee39"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1608058?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keesverruijt","id":1608058,"login":"keesverruijt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDgwNTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keesverruijt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/f4f2a0c66139b99c6b66f5492b2a6fbfa8c2fcd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T05:17:11Z","email":"kees@verruijt.net","name":"Kees Verruijt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T05:17:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: name the forwarder for what it forwards (#107)\n\n`NotificationForwarder` relays whatever paths it is configured with, and\nhas been configured with `radars.` alongside `notifications.` since radar\nstate started reaching Signal K. Reading the name, three files and the\ndivergence notes all said it was notifications only, which is how a\nmissing targets subtree got blamed on a filter that was never narrow.\n\nRename it `DeltaForwarder`, and correct the prose that described the old\nbehaviour: the class doc already said it was configurable, but every\nother mention did not.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e649b0e6fa10ccdbc5c27f8bdde176bebd5c9a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/5e649b0e6fa10ccdbc5c27f8bdde176bebd5c9a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/f4f2a0c66139b99c6b66f5492b2a6fbfa8c2fcd9","verification":{"payload":"tree 5e649b0e6fa10ccdbc5c27f8bdde176bebd5c9a1\nparent 11b712f82ad17f681cc6fecd36eb06aad9bf731f\nauthor Kees Verruijt <kees@verruijt.net> 1786598231 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786598231 +0900\n\nrefactor: name the forwarder for what it forwards (#107)\n\n`NotificationForwarder` relays whatever paths it is configured with, and\nhas been configured with `radars.` alongside `notifications.` since radar\nstate started reaching Signal K. Reading the name, three files and the\ndivergence notes all said it was notifications only, which is how a\nmissing targets subtree got blamed on a filter that was never narrow.\n\nRename it `DeltaForwarder`, and correct the prose that described the old\nbehaviour: the class doc already said it was configurable, but every\nother mention did not.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":