o-transmit sectors — which\ncould not be set through this plugin at all. A compound payload was wrapped in\na second { value } envelope before being sent to mayara-server, which rejected\nit. Scalar controls were unaffected.\n\nNeeds signalk-server 2.31.0-beta.2 or newer for the matching Radar API fix\n(SignalK/signalk-server#2935): before it, the server discarded a compound\ncontrol''s sibling fields before this plugin ever saw them, so a guard-zone PUT\narrived carrying only its start bearing.","tree":{"sha":"07b45de6c047ffb67a083aa63cd64c614138a078","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/07b45de6c047ffb67a083aa63cd64c614138a078"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/11b712f82ad17f681cc6fecd36eb06aad9bf731f","verification":{"payload":"tree 07b45de6c047ffb67a083aa63cd64c614138a078\nparent 66ebd0e3aa6fae6d83046457aa14a9e0fe33322d\nauthor Kees Verruijt <kees@verruijt.net> 1786429382 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786429382 +0900\n\nchore(release): 1.5.0-beta.5 (#106)\n\nFixes compound radar controls — guard zones and no-transmit sectors — which\ncould not be set through this plugin at all. A compound payload was wrapped in\na second { value } envelope before being sent to mayara-server, which rejected\nit. Scalar controls were unaffected.\n\nNeeds signalk-server 2.31.0-beta.2 or newer for the matching Radar API fix\n(SignalK/signalk-server#2935): before it, the server discarded a compound\ncontrol''s sibling fields before this plugin ever saw them, so a guard-zone PUT\narrived carrying only its start bearing.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqer/GCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOrkQAK91YyUPtpzyp+ORuYtfXgR0\nYarFdU6jtZKWag4FtmU/MBCPP7JT8w479ipvHAQWBaKbhLZ+W67HtogAv+z37gOy\nKx4BF+RaNZV63xBfepkHhl97sAhktQXylrTu677ZE99bbanB10bdYod5UoFy7BBv\nrvhn1TshP7ofA6iPjUZy2kI//kTlyQAbjfc26j5+bOlL1hG/wwtRe2aLpbqPiJUo\nx8rbluvU7AcjA