ist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/c7f070a3eb0993426b10a9995a2fb29769fe8d79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T18:30:05Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T18:30:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(release): 1.5.0-beta.4 (#104)\n\nOpens the radar GUI directly on mayara-server by default, rather than\nthrough this plugin''s reverse proxy. Existing installations adopt the new\ndefault on upgrade; disable ''Open the radar GUI directly on mayara-server''\nto keep using the proxy, which is still required when mayara-server''s port\nis not reachable from the browser or when the radar session must inherit\nSignal K''s TLS.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"79aa3e6e0ac3e5451d2dc8618a56e006110791bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/79aa3e6e0ac3e5451d2dc8618a56e006110791bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/c7f070a3eb0993426b10a9995a2fb29769fe8d79","verification":{"payload":"tree 79aa3e6e0ac3e5451d2dc8618a56e006110791bd\nparent 394f36d522d39df1e3455820e1bb40ec5e1561b8\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1786300205 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786300205 +1200\n\nchore(release): 1.5.0-beta.4 (#104)\n\nOpens the radar GUI directly on mayara-server by default, rather than\nthrough this plugin''s reverse proxy. Existing installations adopt the new\ndefault on upgrade; disable ''Open the radar GUI directly on mayara-server''\nto keep using the proxy, which is still required when mayara-server''s port\nis not reachable from the browser or when the radar session must inherit\nSignal K''s TLS.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqeMctCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3HoQADa0zz3Yu2lAcVuismIFwLFP\n3vLgP0USPxcxlzoAv/zbPBhCkr5i3OmGPUun8suYunha9mlkGo8grBG8UEw6U9kP\nH8CIbf1ZtSEYwG3S39bIbeut5fr/o7h8HgRO3FP9NKGtd/ldqxO8P0atjek5/auG\nbrDUc4gR04NgJJklbIGHamiArkYSbsvjmjq/OXGNV87R8NFjNhuiJTsQ2GvJAAuj\ncx09GpeOl1KdfxRn4YAdyFkT7DR+WWT89ua8HhSMItF20PrTOva+0yDsHdhVP9Oi\niXcbS+3C4aXOS5L6ZFIKBR5RulVSIUZSif4oZ3181iHuHJ+DLOIj3/pQR47LT7lp\n1i4ISrut22BJzmQse30HuWEDPrndOTorAOBWKLpV1lqOLAKGPppcp4yUJH6E0Won\nrON63zjT2Ah/bneuuJv6kUU4+TYpaXszFMeQdz5mFcMPCphoaAzn3gwSUegnstf2\noWXCt1uRbPOlCYakOWehXMfm39JS/86dXTs9ICegXl7c5tMK0eW529nkRByDRUeE\nShxJRawCev6sDGlgwu9rDVxwFA3e0eHupF9MJuNmZ7v8TxAs0l12WFZ6jC2OQ/L3\n/qD6pXhrmVKv8Vx1cOq7nUkaWMaBQDHU6ErKdkvec/qJ5cOfn1yM0lmyx8/350H9\nfnLdP0V9IoEd6wT8UH8Z\n=IIQn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-09T18:31:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_even