wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/a6a15a2251a1f2c128e4aa02fb926450942428d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T19:41:05Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T19:41:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(e2e): add a full-stack end-to-end harness (#94)\n\nThe suite is comprehensive but every collaborator is mocked, so a whole class\nof failure is structurally invisible to it: the plugin failing to load under\nESM, the Radar API provider not registering with the server, the GUI reverse\nproxy mis-routing, the federated config panel not being served. Each of those\nis a real regression this refactor could have introduced and no unit test\nwould have caught.\n\ntest/e2e/run-e2e.mjs boots a real signalk-server with the plugin really packed\nand installed into a throwaway config dir, pointed at a real mayara-server.\nNothing is mocked. 19 assertions across plugin load, /status, the Radar API\n(discovery envelope, lean RadarInfo shape, per-radar state, capabilities,\nprovider registration), the spoke WebSocket, the GUI proxy passthrough, and\nthe federated remoteEntry.\n\nAssertions are deliberately strict: the GUI proxy check rejects 4xx (a 404\nmeans the proxy mounted but routed nowhere — the regression it exists to\ncatch), the spoke check requires binary frames rather than counting any\nmessage, and shutdown waits for the real exit event with a SIGKILL escalation\nrather than sleeping and assuming.\n\nDeliberately not wired into npm test, build:all or CI: it needs a running\nmayara-server and, for the radar assertions, real hardware. The vitest glob is\ntest/**/*.test.ts so the .mjs harness is excluded automatically and the\ndefault run stays at 138 tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"df0d0937fe6fa5f859f50aa2e1f060f91581e3d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/df0d0937fe6fa5f859f50aa2e1f060f91581e3d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/a6a15a2251a1f2c128e4aa02fb926450942428d5","verification":{"payload":"tree df0d0937fe6fa5f859f50aa2e1f060f91581e3d9\nparent fd11fe321c8270dc1a83ee2e9b84db46cd27c63b\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1786218065 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786218065 +1200\n\ntest(e2e): add a full-stack end-to-end harness (#94)\n\nThe suite is comprehensive but every collaborator is mocked, so a whole class\nof failure is structurally invisible to it: the plugin failing to load under\nESM, the Radar API provider not registering with the server, the GUI reverse\nproxy mis-routing, the federated config panel not being served. Each of those\nis a real regression this refactor could have introduced and no unit test\nwould have caught.\n\ntest/e2e/run-e2e.mjs boots a real signalk-server with the plugin really packed\nand installed into a throwaway config dir, pointed at a real mayara-server.\nNothing is mocked. 19 assertions across plugin load, /status, the Radar API\n(discovery envelope, lean RadarInfo shape, per-radar state, capabilities,\nprovider registration), the spoke WebSocket, the GUI proxy passthrough, and\nthe federated remoteEntry.\n\nAssertions are deliberately strict: the GUI proxy check rejects 4xx (a 404\nmeans the proxy mounted but routed nowhere — the regression it exists to\ncatch), the spoke check requires binary frames rather than counting any\nmessage, and shutdown waits for the real exit event with a SIGKILL escalation\nrather than sleeping and assuming.\n\nDeliberately not wired into npm test, build:all or CI: it needs a running\nmayara-server and, for the radar assertions, real hardware. The vitest glob is\ntest/**/*.test.ts so the .mjs harness is excluded automatically and the\ndefault run stays at 138 tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqd4ZRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqpEQAAFgbEEkMway/Wf93JzwG9mA\nWtZLgD7UXYaD4MAKkhhIiq/xWbr/0V9i5TdKsC7/Q23JsiVRUBXclYpNOqCmwoZw\nG0rExdzblh0BDX8+ZZreIX3gHRNeUlom1GP0MmrVnJHcD5afC0xe4IbuE9FE2mLp\nGvRIFwTF1J5b4gkePmznZd6EIytfg0GdPOFJsb62EAHXEVKxawCDUzHNSEhZ4PnU\nJKFlFHebi0BiKaB/YhtmZxekihlM8q1X86RinR9Byzb0Fi4Pw8R46OCy0+Z2iOn/\nLSRh670tpqkfpalGNqMVN2x4QHMUaPN4DXki0sjByZW0oqdwnNydK6EeDbb94bXX\nBKd/UNVIbyM7wceT0+wVDWWA9QBAiqn6tZboTWZgOQ/zpeNHjv/y4JRU1RhfvXSZ\njw4+m/hJ2dbRyMncUJThVMSy0HkzWInXFr9sihjDPxl293uAwuNPj9upbyJ/wCi9\nerGLU6tIxN5yCPdheSvBGtFgNZ5yq2IyPyRH5SzZaVz4yrsKeQahfek53+FfAO7h\nLR9r4cd/wKRJ4A6SVxDyNDIeq4bkzBpYLzijap+I1q5rqPmWXnzf4oCLmBU2cRZh\nSOlSz27b5xQsluqmY7cAMznQ/k1lDv13kd+4TctRwqasJoxRe+XzGxBTJUVrT749\nuTwFeb+YEj+cPAfBr6LN\n=DKR3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T19:58:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gith