<dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"88ba20dd0cf3f4ec5cf795f9dfd9098cb175c174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/88ba20dd0cf3f4ec5cf795f9dfd9098cb175c174"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/5d79f4eb975597f0cd179671be7bb3acb5051f1e","verification":{"payload":"tree 88ba20dd0cf3f4ec5cf795f9dfd9098cb175c174\nparent e381b984f00a7d277e278f10b687882222d3e31d\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1780624144 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780624144 +1200\n\nchore(format): add prettier formatting for markdown and config files (#75)\n\nPrettier previously scanned only src/**/*.ts and test/**/*.ts, so\nmarkdown and root config files drifted (AGENTS.md, README.md, and\nwebpack.config.js were never formatted). Extend coverage:\n\n- add format:other (writer) and format:check (checker) over an\n  identical glob covering *.md, root JSON/YAML/JS-config, and the\n  workflow YAMLs, so the two never drift\n- add proseWrap: preserve so hand-wrapped prose is not reflowed\n- add .prettierignore excluding build artifacts (plugin/, public/) and\n  the lockfile\n- wire the reusable CI workflow''s format-check-command input to\n  npm run format:check so unformatted files fail PRs\n\nIncludes the resulting reformat of README.md and webpack.config.js.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIisQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAK8YQAHvmvempH8s91YbcqOvnkiJZ\nL3icPkk9U8HD9bbmob+P7caMFZxZAsgmGKiMTr/dtpw2DuoYa1J+Usw40GZLc8eX\n7ZckCD2xRT3iC/CwzJR0y1P3DZDrncGOEBvUBelMDVPUGdSH/f/HAZvqu28DbeZq\ncisjZAvKVLtcO21R+l3KLPc+qzs0Ull9APtKfR+yb5a2l/Qixr2qQGLYaoC2deBS\n1w21oKFXtGT6Gyy1vUKLF+jliMA7agKL7NcOG6PGPJMkgUqoGCOblp6TEGEDv3M4\nC9DbonD1uT2DiVPgRBRiSMCxWmPzWvshcSpN+VGdnKAD9E+GnZ72tsBWhEvv0m3q\nxcNDhrWJLlmHzZZHg9FDzWMez7t08y4Tc7dpjUOuP0YAhtA6L4CGBbTItqFuzikx\n2o0NTPY6WHMypJ8