ount":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T22:51:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(proxy): forward /v2 API paths to mayara through the GUI proxy (#72)\n\nThe GUI proxy''s pathRewrite only passed /signalk/... straight through and\nprepended /gui to everything else, assuming it was a static asset. But\nmayara also serves API under /v2/... (recordings and the debug panel),\nso those requests were rewritten to /gui/v2/... and 404''d behind the\nSignal K proxy — they only worked in the standalone-direct GUI, where no\nproxy is involved.\n\nExtract the rewrite into an exported pure rewriteGuiProxyPath() that\npasses both /signalk/... and /v2/... through, and unit-test it. Extracting\nto its own module is required for testability: index.ts uses\n`module.exports = function`, which clobbers any ESM export added to the\nsame file.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"493dc172fe68fcd6e689d066444af1e68d0dc8d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/493dc172fe68fcd6e689d066444af1e68d0dc8d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/84cc395dbef23bce6b0adbaba60bf7f4837b0dd3","verification":{"payload":"tree 493dc172fe68fcd6e689d066444af1e68d0dc8d0\nparent 775989219f66f66ca57324b416817897d860d49a\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1780527060 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780527060 +1200\n\nfix(proxy): forward /v2 API paths to mayara through the GUI proxy (#72)\n\nThe GUI proxy''s pathRewrite only passed /signalk/... straight through and\nprepended /gui to everything else, assuming it was a static asset. But\nmayara also serves API under /v2/... (recordings and the debug panel),\nso those requests were rewritten to /gui/v2/... and 404''d behind the\nSignal K proxy — they only worked in the standalone-direct GUI, where no\nproxy is involved.\n\nExtract the rewrite into an exported pure rewriteGuiProxyPath() that\npasses both /signalk/... and /v2/... through, and unit-test it. Extracting\nto its own module is required for testability: index.ts uses\n`module.exports = function`, which clobbers any ESM export added to the\nsame file.\n\nCo-authored-by: dirkwa <dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIK/UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACMYQALHb/YGpOBQcAwS9PuPBwnjq\n1gOIQ87UUxCTGaEVhPaNT4xyIs0PoB1+wG4J/ZWNvyfGavgH92KPmg36bvY2f4Qe\nSOmGO1gSnOCUOVTTeOX38dQLsEtrE4NY8/GsoN1XukSWmvZnoUB7yWVLWux9Ijk3\nFw2aRLIEEJP3HzMTUS7CtnZG+eV189HAl4JokRt/bfzHi/eJlO5aSeng6HceNr9s\naf+nBHX1OB4A/aqdUeYHw3ap0geOJ70LLdI7jYODyyta0JktjM0TIDJS9sBIfbfX\nuqUuYmfVFpc5ZGcpgOoPsCBmER7I3VHaSUfmqs8baXs8GfCiBRtHVZYSQUCntvLa\nGfpx5Gixy/vcvz3hgVBkvP07MFwoym6cSLV4oUKoSCp43uw4K83Ll//7CxzhB9L6\nBWu54mw1C9Jx7iay1zKt+CM02wEm0DYjUwdhkTruI3RmbeQ5bFnh1j2yM7RsLVu/\nvJ0eAfdtU6yY5jnvcSvsROOsqSDWNkwwPbY2Hjh7735X80195UAHm0xH70DTM32N\nJyBPjkVGPicGmzWlVvEcEw1z13Sn8bfnL6lFrMVMPm0WHjP1Hfh8vEtw68uPYGcz\nfvMOthSbeWuixracImxxWqXzSeayBnz8uVTPcdjfWjzlzIkelTbUpayQ1v4+Cr2I\nGI94Wm9BHQvkfZ8TYE4S\n=/KDm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-03T22:51:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}