d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/3545d844710f1cd7b1835046694f99b1cfb868fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T03:48:48Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T03:48:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): drop signalk-container npm peer dependency (#70)\n\nsignalk-container is a cross-plugin runtime dependency discovered via\nglobalThis.__signalk_containerManager and installed through Signal K''s\nappstore — not something npm should resolve. Declaring it as a peer made\nnpm enforce the >=1.9.0 range, which broke @beta/prerelease installs with\nERESOLVE (npm excludes prereleases from plain >= ranges). It stays\ndeclared via signalk.requires, which is the correct Signal K mechanism.","tree":{"sha":"06e9a1e18810b00f9fa0cbfecc06a8c3bdd01c11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/06e9a1e18810b00f9fa0cbfecc06a8c3bdd01c11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/3545d844710f1cd7b1835046694f99b1cfb868fd","verification":{"payload":"tree 06e9a1e18810b00f9fa0cbfecc06a8c3bdd01c11\nparent adf97b8514b85b831c526d7a8c02b8d87ef36540\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1780372128 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780372128 +1200\n\nfix(deps): drop signalk-container npm peer dependency (#70)\n\nsignalk-container is a cross-plugin runtime dependency discovered via\nglobalThis.__signalk_containerManager and installed through Signal K''s\nappstore — not something npm should resolve. Declaring it as a peer made\nnpm enforce the >=1.9.0 range, which broke @beta/prerelease installs with\nERESOLVE (npm excludes prereleases from plain >= ranges). It stays\ndeclared via signalk.requires, which is the correct Signal K mechanism.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHlKgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJ2EQAGJ+hrkihhNVPvXvTzL8wmdc\nrIzNMk2t9Y3fbUDqpWoRKOvWzSBhUwnjIjBT0yCG7kf/2jAS4kfg29QybST1XEcI\nBFFVsD9H7wJP/Rq8N71+acFH0DHd8Vme2K68r47K6PYvXQijMNXe+bIKMY0cQAGe\nj6DdDlZMb+M7DYaz0CrJ66om3zqmjn6lkL1kLAaNXfVeeo11Jk/2cU9Co9oE0Fpr\nwyZP+FR+Hc9dwGSfYOxQEGTJXnCMPWUL6VirpuFSF7FbAuOM1Iy6HXBBT/deGnfm\nu0PVD7JdkNivLP4uLgpi0tAEjnMBynAHRwD5pGlm4O5H2IhIRgcGWiBS21F5BRhV\nZHxPDg+vImQUK0TN0fX/eaOQ35ebCwtDCvS0KwXKOA3kMoT8CDMNWZCzWhH4Y6Ol\nIx4ZLKvPPUDiyK6INJ4jT4WuO9LfKfZSJk3H59TlpQEqIGpYCpf494PMgWJWewPb\nMPByEWl0P0e9IlYeGSnu15ayW0Pav8WRhHhj+fBJ+wnVGht/ZLgu9neU80w47x/s\nTgTpOjCGOIqGwMonLLtElOw0tD80y8GEDu2BzJ/FTmzT6yp9J6rUf5naXr2R/TLa\nwRnMre8zj8SdahllIw6MVrZrAnwCp+jk6nNm5LoZ7e3Zpih3AaByd4r4dZoIhqUT\nKV8t0zr1f93I0iBJ9Jc6\n=DoBM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-02T03:48:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commit/3545d844710f1cd7b1835046694f99b1cfb868fd","node_id":"C_kwDOQqtUNdoAKDM1NDVkODQ0NzEwZjFjZDdiMTgzNTA0NjY5NGY5OWIxY2ZiODY4ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commit/adf97b8514b85b831c526d7a8c02b8d87ef36540","sha":"adf97b8514b85b831c526d7a8c02b8d87ef36540","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/adf97b8514b85b831c526d7a8c02b8d87ef36540"}],"sha":"3545d844710f1cd7b1835046694f99b1cfb868fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/3545d844710f1cd7b1835046694f99b1cfb868fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/adf97b8514b85b831c526d7a8c02b8d87ef36540/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T02:38:38Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T02:38:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: update Signal K auth section for resilient token handling (#69)\n\nThe token is delivered to the container via the MAYARA_SIGNALK_TOKEN env\nvar, not a --signalk-token-file bind mount as the README said. Also, the\nplugin now validates the cached token on start and re-requests on its own\nwhen denied/revoked/expired, so the manual ''rm the token file and restart''\nrevoke instructions no longer apply.\n\nCorrect the delivery mechanism, rewrite the revoke section, document the\nauto-recovery behaviour, add a Features bullet, and cross-reference the\nmayara-server GUI status banner.","tree":{"sha":"588e480ae74a8e885b79946b5d5fae5def3993b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/588e480ae74a8e885b79946b5d5fae5def3993b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/adf97b8514b85b831c526d7a8c02b8d87ef36540","verification":{"payload":"tree 588e480ae74a8e885b79946b5d5fae5def3993b4\nparent 97c711467c0e6b1beddb7cd3748057969ff77f51\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1780367918 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780367918 +1200\n\ndocs: update Signal K auth section for resilient token handling (#69)\n\nThe token is delivered to the container via the MAYARA_SIGNALK_TOKEN env\nvar, not a --signalk-token-file bind mount as the README said. Also, the\nplugin now validates the cached token on start and re-requests on its own\nwhen denied/revoked/expired, so the manual ''rm the token file and restart''\nrevoke instructions no longer apply.\n\nCorrect the delivery mechanism, rewrite the revoke section, document the\nauto-recovery behaviour, add a Features bullet, and cross-reference the\nmayara-server GUI status banner.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNA