":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/0ec621a13b01ed65305c2903f393aac739054357/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T22:09:40Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T22:09:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(token): auto-recover the SignalK device token without a restart (#63)\n\nPreviously, if the device-access request was denied/expired, device\nrequests were disabled, or the POST errored, token acquisition gave up\nuntil the plugin was restarted — so an operator who approved the request\n(or enabled device requests) afterwards saw no AIS until they bounced the\nplugin.\n\nWrap ensureSignalkToken in a bounded re-request loop: recoverable\noutcomes re-attempt on the reconnect cadence (capped so a permanently\ndenied install doesn''t poll forever), while a cached/approved token or\ndisabled security ends it. The existing tokenPollerCancelled flag set by\nstop() ends the loop promptly so it never outlives the plugin.","tree":{"sha":"b8275e091541a8911eaa7204a33e667d7312df4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/b8275e091541a8911eaa7204a33e667d7312df4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/0ec621a13b01ed65305c2903f393aac739054357","verification":{"payload":"tree b8275e091541a8911eaa7204a33e667d7312df4b\nparent 9caf444020180bd3b838ba25b97a2d9bd5f4b540\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1780351780 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780351780 +1200\n\nfeat(token): auto-recover the SignalK device token without a restart (#63)\n\nPreviously, if the device-access request was denied/expired, device\nrequests were disabled, or the POST errored, token acquisition gave up\nuntil the plugin was restarted — so an operator who approved the request\n(or enabled device requests) afterwards saw no AIS until they bounced the\nplugin.\n\nWrap ensureSignalkToken in a bounded re-request loop: recoverable\noutcomes re-attempt on the reconnect cadence (capped so a permanently\ndenied install doesn''t poll forever), while a cached/approved token or\ndisabled security ends it. The existing tokenPollerCancelled flag set by\nstop() ends the loop promptly so it never outlives the plugin.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHgMkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZjoQABWvikDRzoFmM9k2GIRrkIzW\nbQxWjq72jEjOLXKiVgzb+anZf8nowGEU89zEkp0hoplljE8NleM+9oBvgq9jYQFh\nRxx53O6eI+XPg2MDcV5XPrfiv5jWb7drWj8KJu71MHiUtIsZq8KNyx13NCsJlsMz\nsZZ2hDZQ2c5ygO7L12/KLNnHNelxGGhoYLGvKvNNF46JEkkISaVMWfaF/NV/MtRE\nUBHBUxUw0uqc+HlEoP55Qv+AirBpUwY7V9A9KH6ULP0odVbKZoCNGqM5aOxenjvI\nVw8/bADnJfcn3T+druq2O0H4TBlM7J4xWdvF+nk5mHev7HJ2eUXDuDlV9IfZKN2n\nJ1qAsWVlxXTpa2uMk721e3iA8zoMS9RVfSTMxzmQAxXdY96ebVDHjuravHgA4VoP\ngvXPpfbq7EFn+cnSr60Cy5UeSih9cLs/JwGUWIX/P68t8cFxuGc5g+qgsKzCOrZj\nPKiDPCXPRG3KRpLmumQbLDWcxcUOOoC0+99XuHDd9wagj7oW2FREiQbZBGTwPF2L\nOR0JepXTBnbac7caY7lS2XXHLweAvbxxUreO60GRDEkId4dhS/8Ylvpwu38kx+l3\n3qiEe9A