se files in the project.\n\nIgnore the non-project files (config-panel .js, *.config.{js,mjs,ts}, build.js)\nso they aren''t fed to the type-aware parser. The lint script already globs only\nsrc/test *.ts; this keeps a full-tree run consistent with it. The panel and\nconfig files keep their own style and are unaffected.","tree":{"sha":"f6793a8657fd21809b01acc525032f132646e3aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/f6793a8657fd21809b01acc525032f132646e3aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/ca8fafc93ee1decc69a383c3d5fe788e02b34fe4","verification":{"payload":"tree f6793a8657fd21809b01acc525032f132646e3aa\nparent 2850fb0e70562f4af0ede25d5e2414ade8bd757a\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1780344510 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780344510 +1200\n\nci: scope eslint type-aware linting to project sources (#61)\n\nA repo-wide `eslint .` (as CodeRabbit runs) failed with a parsing error on\nevery file outside tsconfig.eslint.json — the root config files and the\nhand-written .js config panel — because parserOptions.project was applied\nglobally and the typed parser can''t find those files in the project.\n\nIgnore the non-project files (config-panel .js, *.config.{js,mjs,ts}, build.js)\nso they aren''t fed to the type-aware parser. The lint script already globs only\nsrc/test *.ts; this keeps a full-tree run consistent with it. The panel and\nconfig files keep their own style and are unaffected.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHea+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz5QQAEQ4F5Ksyl1YliOPgwcvaapa\nYPzZ8lv/MJzqZi0dn4YVVHTb7zQETrDbC30jWDvsj/d9zK23SsyDi6JwZvYZ+ag2\nBZJ0ETyspDWqGcYeWaELiGPdpROyS0LNIYq9S8T3YNO1koZZbFNzEtRbFbCW6aPt\niX1lsFMgp5s6nRc6vgl3ON1EWtAO7S4FozIhXDEcGLcCHMkbeaBY/A54Ndiw5+j/\n6X0yPAAAUEg9xN9pIW3CODiKDdRO5MzCdLERMpVlNev58XYSubQP/LQvYeaVZ79D\n/VAFFicNR+8cboGAnnaP+9rnvRF5F2dMS9+rE