rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/ca8fafc93ee1decc69a383c3d5fe788e02b34fe4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commits/2850fb0e70562f4af0ede25d5e2414ade8bd757a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T20:07:25Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T20:07:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: offer per-PR test images in the version dropdown (#60)\n\nThe server repo builds an ephemeral pr<N> Docker image when a maintainer\nadds the build-image label to a PR. Surface those images in the config\npanel''s version dropdown so a tester can pick one without typing the tag.\n\n/api/versions now fetches open PRs alongside releases (Promise.allSettled so\none source failing degrades rather than blanks the dropdown) and returns the\nlabeled ones as {tag, pr, title}. The panel renders them in a fenced\n\"PR test images\" optgroup and excludes them from the update-available check.\n\npr<N> is not in signalk-container''s floating-tag set, so it stays pinned and\nis not auto-pulled on rebuild — a tester clicks Update to get the newest\nbuild. A labeled-but-not-yet-built PR surfaces as a normal pull error.","tree":{"sha":"17dcbe3f140d751ca6f85d6b0e071a23912a7ba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/17dcbe3f140d751ca6f85d6b0e071a23912a7ba9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/2850fb0e70562f4af0ede25d5e2414ade8bd757a","verification":{"payload":"tree 17dcbe3f140d751ca6f85d6b0e071a23912a7ba9\nparent aa05bff5a8b0e92867e2d5b29e4ecae42131ed69\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1780344445 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780344445 +1200\n\nfeat: offer per-PR test images in the version dropdown (#60)\n\nThe server repo builds an ephemeral pr<N> Docker image when a maintainer\nadds the build-image label to a PR. Surface those images in the config\npanel''s version dropdown so a tester can pick one without typing the tag.\n\n/api/versions now fetches open PRs alongside releases (Promise.allSettled so\none source failing degrades rather than blanks the dropdown) and returns the\nlabeled ones as {tag, pr, title}. The panel renders them in a fenced\n\"PR test images\" optgroup and excludes them from the update-available check.\n\npr<N> is not in signalk-container''s floating-tag set, so it stays pinned and\nis not auto-pulled on rebuild — a tester clicks Update to get the newest\nbuild. A labeled-but-not-yet-built PR surfaces as a normal pull error.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHeZ9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzqoQADu0E+EmkIg455UzaaXfSqiM\nIQ0yyT17YXJTOjE8blRrTDTpIJxtqnitOdXRIGNAIDHWPxpruPzoS1WV4cqa/MQI\nbBLNZjAQrVU0+tIV9g/ezynoXD+8U6l530carY0dEi34WWof/gYNC76m14gTDBnx\nQBlWjnsKM6DKVTGDJ9iWJrkwluqvTrqUOZOn2LN1gDDJKzaRXRMySVkdfHvjsw