ent_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T20:47:03Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"message":"fix(container): auto-pull newer mayara-server image when tag is floating\n\nA boat that started on `mayara-server:latest` keeps the cached image\nforever — ensureRunning short-circuits on the matching image+tag\nstring and never probes the registry. New radar protocol fixes,\nMARPA improvements, etc. only land when the operator clicks Update\nby hand.\n\nSet `autoUpdateOnFloatingTag: true` in buildContainerConfig so\nsignalk-container (≥1.9.0) pulls on every ensureRunning when the\ntag classifies as floating, compares the registry digest to the\nlive container''s image, and recreates on drift. Offline tolerance\nis provided by signalk-container — pull failures classified as\noffline (ENOTFOUND, ENETUNREACH, etc.) are logged at debug and the\ncached container is left running, so boats out of cell coverage\nstill boot. Semver-pinned versions are classified non-floating and\nskip the probe entirely, so the field is a no-op for pinned\ndeployments.\n\nAlso bumps the peerDependencies floor to >=1.9.0 (the version that\nintroduced the field), adds the corresponding ContainerConfig field\nto src/types.ts, documents the behavior in AGENTS.md + README, and\nadds a regression assertion in container-integration.test.ts.","tree":{"sha":"508c6e42b471a69044141a9e5d423fd026301e0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/trees/508c6e42b471a69044141a9e5d423fd026301e0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/git/commits/2da07c52739ee5a6a9f7cd85bb9cb4ef82ad7c91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MarineYachtRadar/mayara-server-signalk-plugin/commit/2da07c52739ee5a6a9f7cd85bb9cb4ef82ad7c91","node_id":"C_kwDOQqtUNdoAKDJkYTA3YzUyNzM5ZWU1YTZhOWY3Y2Q4NWJiOWNiNGVmODJhZD