e":"2025-12-18T05:12:56Z","email":"neuralsplash@gmail.com","name":"Ja"},"message":"Fix chapter extraction: use positions instead of markers\n\n- Changed chapter identification to return start_pos/end_pos instead of\n  text markers (which were fragile and often didn''t match)\n- Added parse_json_response() helper to handle malformed JSON from LLM\n- Skip front matter, bibliographies, etc. - focus on main chapters\n- Simplified model names to gemini-2.5-flash and gemini-2.5-pro\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c743b5573ea9d5252f06b7219ce11557324fbec1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ratacat/claude-skills/git/trees/c743b5573ea9d5252f06b7219ce11557324fbec1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ratacat/claude-skills/git/commits/cd9fd1dbc35b0efbdbd2e8c895d646e7eaffdc06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3517397?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ratacat","id":3517397,"login":"ratacat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTczOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ratacat/claude-skills/commit/cd9fd1dbc35b0ef