eral (covers whole domain)\n  2. Focused (emphasizes unique value)\n  3. Practical (emphasizes hands-on tasks)\n- User selects from the proposals interactively\n- Pipeline now has 6 steps (added Propose step)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"129f3d1bcb457edecc88efaec3e58735e10148cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ratacat/claude-skills/git/trees/129f3d1bcb457edecc88efaec3e58735e10148cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ratacat/claude-skills/git/commits/62459848dd7ff1d7def52e67228bc2573173f397","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3517397?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ratacat","id":3517397,"login":"ratacat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTczOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ratacat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ratacat/claude-skills/commit/62459848dd7ff1d7def52e67228bc2573173f397","node_id":"C_kwDOQqvo_9oAKDYyNDU5ODQ4ZGQ3ZmYxZDdkZWY1MmU2NzIyOGJjMjU3MzE3M2YzOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ratacat/claude-skills/commit/c81234b0195c523c28af58e55636ea4a6b9c179e","sha":"c81234b0195c523c28af58e55636ea4a6b9c179e",