calhost:8000/admin/\n- API Documentation: Built into demo\n\n💡 Ready for Development:\n- Backend: 100% functional and tested\n- Frontend: Structure ready (requires npm setup)\n- Module Federation: Configured and ready\n- Production configs: Docker-ready\n\nThe system demonstrates a working micro-frontend architecture\nwith fully operational REST API backend and demo interface.","tree":{"sha":"3a42e7b3f465277d996157ff66654e1cbb87b9b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/git/trees/3a42e7b3f465277d996157ff66654e1cbb87b9b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/git/commits/20829e6f715752418f31f9bf2fd7b9fb633cc90c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/commit/20829e6f715752418f31f9bf2fd7b9fb633cc90c","node_id":"C_kwDOQrN23doAKDIwODI5ZTZmNzE1NzUyNDE4ZjMxZjliZjJmZDdiOWZiNjMzY2M5MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/commit/1e963b333af7d503a15fcae3b268684cc1dc6259","sha":"1e963b333af7d503a15fcae3b268684cc1dc6259","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/commits/1e963b333af7d503a15fcae3b268684cc1dc6259"}],"sha":"20829e6f715752418f31f9bf2fd7b9fb633cc90c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/commits/20829e6f715752418f31f9bf2fd7b9fb633cc90c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/commits/1e963b333af7d503a15fcae3b268684cc1dc6259/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-19T18:07:03Z","email":"dev@enterprise-dashboard.com","name":"Enterprise Dashboard Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-19T18:07:03Z","email":"dev@enterprise-dashboard.com","name":"Enterprise Dashboard Dev"},"message":"feat: add comprehensive development scripts and fix project paths\n\n🚀 Added Scripts:\n- dev.sh: Universal development environment with multiple modes\n- quick-start.sh: Simple Django-only launcher\n- minimal-start.sh: Fallback script for minimal setups\n- start-services.js: Enhanced Node.js cross-platform script\n- start-services.sh: Enhanced Bash script for Linux/macOS\n- start-services.bat: Enhanced Batch script for Windows\n\n🔧 Fixed Issues:\n- Updated all project.json paths from apps/ to root level\n- Fixed Angular and React project configurations\n- Added graceful error handling and service detection\n- Implemented timeout protection for long-running processes\n- Added comprehensive status checking\n\n📋 Development Modes:\n- ./dev.sh quick     # Django only (instant startup)\n- ./dev.sh backend   # Full Django setup with migrations\n- ./dev.sh frontend  # Install npm deps and start frontends\n- ./dev.sh full      # Complete environment setup\n- ./dev.sh status    # Check running services\n- ./dev.sh stop      # Stop all services\n- ./dev.sh clean     # Clean caches and dependencies\n\n✅ Tested on Ubuntu:\n- Django API works perfectly with JWT authentication\n- Admin user creation and authentication functional\n- Service management and health checks working\n- Proper cleanup and shutdown procedures\n\n🎯 Ready for cross-platform development!","tree":{"sha":"7044bdcef57c234ef048f770ef8d2d2227f22c72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/git/trees/7044bdcef57c234ef048f770ef8d2d2227f22c72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/git/commits/1e963b333af7d503a15fcae3b268684cc1dc6259","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/commit/1e963b333af7d503a15fcae3b268684cc1dc6259","node_id":"C_kwDOQrN23doAKDFlOTYzYjMzM2FmN2Q1MDNhMTVmY2FlM2IyNjg2O