r cloning and immediate development use\n\n🎯 Features Ready:\n- Micro-frontend architecture with Angular shell + React analytics\n- Enterprise-grade authentication and authorization\n- Dashboard and widget management system\n- Cross-framework communication via Module Federation\n- Production deployment with Docker, nginx, SSL\n- Windows-specific optimizations and scripts\n- Complete documentation and troubleshooting guides\n\n🌐 Access URLs:\n- Angular Shell: http://localhost:4200\n- React Analytics: http://localhost:4201\n- Django API: http://localhost:8000/api/\n- Django Admin: http://localhost:8000/admin/\n\n🔑 Default Credentials:\n- Username: admin\n- Password: Enterprise123!\n\nReady for Windows cloning and enterprise development!","tree":{"sha":"61bcb68b77ec1a4fc1b0d0c99a17f7fa423d624a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/git/trees/61bcb68b77ec1a4fc1b0d0c99a17f7fa423d624a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/git/commits/406374608ea559757899240f64701a5225a44a38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/commit/406374608ea559757899240f64701a5225a44a38","node_id":"C_kwDOQrN23doAKDQwNjM3NDYwOGVhNTU5NzU3ODk5MjQwZjY0NzAxYTUyMjVhNDRhMzg","parents":[],"sha":"406374608ea559757899240f64701a5225a44a38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/commits/406374608ea559757899240f64701a5225a44a38"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarcosLesca/enterprise-dashboard-microfrontend/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=c07f94c0aa4ef08f3c24fbfb0c9d1fe7a5eea61a&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A40%3A31.763Z"}');
