,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commits/6f8adee2aa308c0a4af02f9185eba2a19a8aa37e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T20:32:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T20:32:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add SCXQ2 Container Engine for 1000 Brains/Icons/Clusters\n\n[24] SCXQ2 Container Engine v1.0:\n- Binary format: SCX2BRAIN with 64-byte header, section table, 16-byte alignment\n- BRAIN_TBL: 1000 brains (64 bytes each) with vocab/tokenizer/policy hashes\n- ICON_TBL: 1000 icons (48 bytes each) — carriers, never authoritative\n- CLUS_TBL: 1000 clusters (64 bytes each) — compute substrates, never decide\n- EDGE_TBL: Adjacency edges + class-order validation rules\n- PROOFS: ⚡ proof bundles with canonical hashes\n\nCritical collapse boundary: cluster output → canonicalize → ⚡ → branch gate\nSystem law: Icons identify. Clusters compute. Brains decide. Only ⚡ collapses truth.\n\nUpdates claude.md with SCXQ2 and Brain Taxonomy (10 classes A-J).\nBumps version to 1.2.9.","tree":{"sha":"75720f7e76c277342bb2819cf1508354dcc0d824","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/git/trees/75720f7e76c277342bb2819cf1508354dcc0d824"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/git/commits/6f8adee2aa308c0a4af02f9185eba2a19a8aa37e","verification":{"payload":"tree 75720f7e76c277342bb2819cf1508354dcc0d824\nparent 0daa4a946c59cce62f984456e23c75861ecfc4c9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1766349173 +0000\ncommitter Claude <no