/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commit/0daa4a946c59cce62f984456e23c75861ecfc4c9","node_id":"C_kwDOQrY38toAKDBkYWE0YTk0NmM1OWNjZTYyZjk4NDQ1NmUyM2M3NTg2MWVjZmM0Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commit/f062d5018cfc7970ee43530eeb4744e76f4b8e17","sha":"f062d5018cfc7970ee43530eeb4744e76f4b8e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commits/f062d5018cfc7970ee43530eeb4744e76f4b8e17"}],"sha":"0daa4a946c59cce62f984456e23c75861ecfc4c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commits/0daa4a946c59cce62f984456e23c75861ecfc4c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commits/f062d5018cfc7970ee43530eeb4744e76f4b8e17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T19:07:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T19:07:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add K''UHUL π Virtual Cluster v1.0\n\n[22] K''UHUL π Virtual Cluster — browser-native distributed computing\nvia mathematical regeneration instead of weight storage.\n\nComponents:\n- PiNode: Virtual compute unit with state machine\n  (BOOTSTRAP→DISCOVERING→CONNECTING→SYNCING→READY→DEGRADED→RECOVERING→OFFLINE)\n- SyncEngine: CRDT-based state sync with LWW merge + vector clock\n- MathRegenEngine: Weight regeneration using f(x,c)=sin(x*c*π)*cos(x*e)*(1+φ*tanh(x))\n- RecoveryProtocol: Auto-recovery with 3 strategies (resync, reset, hard reset)\n- ClusterController: Main API with singleton pattern\n\nNew files:\n- SPEC-KPC-V1.0.md: Full specification document\n\nUpdates:\n- claude.md: Added Virtual Cluster section with API reference\n- sw.js: Added [22] section (~500 lines), bumped to v1.2.7\n\nKey invariants:\n- Weights regenerated deterministically from seed + position\n- CRDT consensus threshold: 67%\n- Max recovery attempts: 5\n- All transitions audited via hash-chain","tree":{"sha":"8cbf8303bd0e7ecb92bd92931eac68ed74ba5dda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/git/trees/8cbf8303bd0e7ecb92bd92931eac68ed74ba5dda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/git/commits/f062d5018cfc7970ee43530eeb4744e76f4b8e17","verification":{"payload":"tree 8cbf8303bd0e7ecb92bd92931eac68ed74ba5dda\nparent 6c49228a3791eda0fe3a0238e4d0a4bc6cc4dcb7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1766344034 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1766344034 +0000\n\nAdd K''UHUL π Virtual Cluster v1.0\n\n[22] K''UHUL π Virtual Cluster — browser-native distributed computing\nvia mathematical regeneration instead of weight storage.\n\nComponents:\n- PiNode: Virtual compute unit with state machine\n  (BOOTSTRAP→DISCOVERING→CONNECTING→SYNCING→READY→DEGRADED→RECOVERING→OFFLINE)\n- SyncEngine: CRDT-based state sync with LWW merge + vector clock\n- MathRegenEngine: Weight regeneration using f(x,c)=sin(x*c*π)*cos(x*e)*(1+φ*tanh(x))\n- RecoveryProtocol: Auto-recovery with 3 strategies (resync, reset, hard reset)\n- ClusterController: Main API with singleton pattern\n\nNew files:\n- SPEC-KPC-V1.0.md: Full specification document\n\nUpdates:\n- claude.md: Added Virtual Cluster section with API reference\n- sw.js: Added [22] section (~500 lines), bumped to v1.2.7\n\nKey invariants:\n- Weights regenerated deterministically from seed + position\n- CRDT consensus threshold: 67%\n- Max recovery attempts: 5\n- All transitions audited via hash-chain\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJC+9HzD\n1hBA5zw2b9iecvWP3PKHRsqk3xL4w+u4fo9PovK6B0I1k57fLPZtKJFAkeT9gJnjhWRQPGQKzCv/\nFgo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-21T19:07:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use