":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commits/7e7f3418da144d793c6dde8b86c92e43fdcbe53d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T18:24:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T18:24:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add ASM v1.0 transformer and XCFE Replay Verifier\n\n[20] ASM v1.0 — Atomic Symbolic Markup Transformer:\n- Core invariant: symbols as attributes, not tag names\n- ⚛️X element symbols (D=div, H=header, M=main, N=nav, etc.)\n- ⟁X composition tokens (MC, C0, N1, etc.)\n- Output modes: \"attrs\" | \"data\" | \"class\"\n- DOM-based transform (no regex), replaceTag preserves children\n- fromHTML() for template parsing\n\n[21] XCFE Replay Verifier v1:\n- Core invariant: control flow is cryptographic consequence of truth collapse\n- MX2_CANON_JSON_v1.0 canonicalization (sorted keys, normalized numbers)\n- SHA-256 proofs via SubtleCrypto\n- @epoch_policy validation with policy_hash pinning\n- @⚡ Lightning event verification (proof_hash = H(input_hash:truth))\n- @xcfe.branch_gate verification (requires verified proof in ValidProofSet)\n- @rotation_replay_result output with failure_stage diagnostics\n- Audit integration for xcfe.verify events\n\nBumps kernel version to 1.2.6","tree":{"sha":"3750b38dcc795d886ade20dbf3fcee85e9af5d24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/git/trees/3750b38dcc795d886ade20dbf3fcee85e9af5d24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/git/commits/7e7f3418da144d793c6dde8b86c92e43fdcbe53d","verification":{"payload":"tree 3750b38dcc795d886ade20dbf3fcee85e9af5d24\nparent 4325055f50407559c6ea7bf787a86bc0206a573c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1766341497 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1766341497 +0000\n\nAdd ASM v1.0 transformer and XCFE Replay Verifier\n\n[20] ASM v1.0 — Atomic Symbolic Markup Transformer:\n- Core invariant: symbols as attributes, not tag names\n- ⚛️X element symbols (D=div, H=header, M=main, N=nav, etc.)\n- ⟁X composition tokens (MC, C0, N1, etc.)\n- Output modes: \"attrs\" | \"data\" | \"class\"\n- DOM-based transform (no regex), replaceTag preserves children\n- fromHTML() for template parsing\n\n[21] XCFE Replay Verifier v1:\n- Core invariant: control flow is cryptographic consequence of truth collapse\n- MX2_CANON_JSON_v1.0 canonicalization (sorted keys, normalized numbers)\n- SHA-256 proofs via SubtleCrypto\n- @epoch_policy validation with policy_hash pinning\n- @⚡ Lightning event verification (proof_hash = H(input_hash:truth))\n- @xcfe.branch_gate verification (requires verified proof in ValidProofSet)\n- @rotation_replay_result output with failure_stage diagnostics\n- Audit integration for xcfe.verify events\n\nBumps kernel version to 1.2.6\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQI6Dd7yN\nSeNvNraLclfxRAf8UkzO38Xgc0QuVmZ3h1A/ISX1phMxpGkMhYJpJDUAcLQQf2INHQwdkbMp+52M\nkQY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-21T18:25:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"