uditable envelope, SHA-256 proofs via SubtleCrypto,\n  cache keys for research packets, glyph router and resolver\n\n- [18] Proxy Bridge Client (PART E): host probing with TTL cache,\n  packet sending with SHA-256 proof generation, response verification,\n  glyph-based execution with caching support, PROXY/DIRECT mode switching\n\n- [19] Unified Runtime v4.1 (K''UHUL π Core Loop): Pop→Wo→Sek→Tick\n  execution model, agent creation as atomic blocks, glyph-weighted\n  activation accumulation, energy decay, signal emission on threshold,\n  cluster detection based on activation similarity, answer collapse\n  from cluster consensus\n\nBumps kernel version to 1.2.5\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCWp+0ZY\n1hhNoSIXfbMIZf2QKDd82ZB1qBOeIbNNkbQ5WVMEIgucB7TU8vQrunMsD2mP+HNUqbnylqCrBb9n\njQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-21T17:29:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/c