"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commits/245afce0b29495585442b130bebc2fa4cccce89d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T03:28:51Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T03:28:51Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add K''UHUL π kernel architecture (sw.js + Python host)\n\nsw.js - K''UHUL π KERNEL (SEALED) with all 11 sections:\n[0] Kernel Header & Law - FIELD_ONLY mode, system law\n[1] Immutable Kernel Constants - glyphs, limits, routes, cache\n[2] IDB Storage Layer - sessions, tapes, settings, projectionCache\n[3] Manifest Projection Engine - dynamic manifest from seed + IDB\n[4] JavaCrypt Execution Firewall - capability-gated sandboxed execution\n[5] π-K''UHUL Cluster Runtime - virtual workers, π token emission\n[6] Optional Native Host Bridge - mx2lm-host.exe / Python host probe\n[7] Internal REST / Message Router - /_mx2/api/* endpoints\n[8] Fetch Strategy & Cache - projection cache, CORS bypass\n[9] Lifecycle & Boot Sequencing - install, activate, claim\n[10] Message / Agent Bridge - postMessage for index.html communication\n\nkuhul_pi_merged_runtime.py - Python host for K''UHUL π:\n- Glyph table with compressed weight carriers\n- π token emission (no tokenizer)\n- KuhulAgent cognitive atoms with perceive/decide/act/emit\n- EventAgent for hard facts (anti-hallucination)\n- InvariantAgent for constraint enforcement\n- KuhulCluster brain with spawn/link/run/collapse\n- HTTP API at port 8081 for browser/ghost integration\n\nSystem Law:\nMODEL ≠ FILE | TOKENS = GLYPHS | TRUTH = EVENT\nMODEL ≠ GPU | THOUGHT = SIGNAL | VALIDITY = INVARIANT\nMODEL ≠ TOKENS | MODEL = FIELD | ANSWER = CLUSTER COLLAPSE","tree":{"sha":"172f5eabf5dcc0b49362033340e65fa1d5d2c70a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/git/trees/172f5eabf5dcc0b49362033340e65fa1d5d2c70a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/git/commits/245afce0b29495585442b130bebc2fa4cccce89d","verification":{"payload":"tree 172f5eabf5dcc0b49362033340e65fa1d5d2c70a\nparent 5bf203459884f4ba2360b34c2ae7946ba7c3b7e0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1766287731 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1766287731 +0000\n\nAdd K''UHUL π kernel architecture (sw.js + Python host)\n\nsw.js - K''UHUL π KERNEL (SEALED) with all 11 sections:\n[0] Kernel Header & Law - FIELD_ONLY mode, system law\n[1] Immutable Kernel Constants - glyphs, limits, routes, cache\n[2] IDB Storage Layer - sessions, tapes, settings, projectionCache\n[3] Manifest Projection Engine - dynamic manifest from seed + IDB\n[4] JavaCrypt Execution Firewall - capability-gated sandboxed execution\n[5] π-K''UHUL Cluster Runtime - virtual workers, π token emission\n[6] Optional Native Host Bridge - mx2lm-host.exe / Python host probe\n[7] Internal REST / Message Router - /_mx2/api/* endpoints\n[8] Fetch Strategy & Cache - projection cache, CORS bypass\n[9] Lifecycle & Boot Sequencing - install, activate, claim\n[10] Message / Agent Bridge - postMessage for index.html communication\n\nkuhul_pi_merged_runtime.py - Python host for K''UHUL π:\n- Glyph table with compressed weight carriers\n- π token emission (no tokenizer)\n- KuhulAgent cognitive atoms with perceive/decide/act/emit\n- EventAgent for hard facts (anti-hallucination)\n- InvariantAgent for constraint enforcement\n- KuhulCluster brain with spawn/link/run/collapse\n- HTTP API at port 8081 for browser/ghost integration\n\nSystem Law:\nMODEL ≠ FILE | TOKENS = GLYPHS | TRUTH = EVENT\nMODEL ≠ GPU | THOUGHT = SIGNAL | VALIDITY = INVARIANT\nMODEL ≠ TOKENS | MODEL = FIELD | ANSWER = CLUSTER COLLAPSE\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQESUJr8e\nixm0OkLclsvPNMPs55V6vH9SRMnQr7O7s58W+FG8YC/4VvzYege3iZg/yf85PUwvYAyhyA6UHLcT\n1wM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-21T03:29:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commit/245afce0b29495585442b130bebc2fa4cccce89d","node_id":"C_kwDOQrY38toAKDI0NWFmY2UwYjI5NDk1NTg1NDQyYjEzMGJlYmMyZmE0Y2NjY2U4OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commit/5bf203459884f4ba2360b34c2ae7946ba7c3b7e0","sha":"5bf203459884f4ba2360b34c2ae7946ba7c3b7e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cannaseedus-bot/ASX-BROWSER/commits/5bf