845cae52857df354198c79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-19T14:16:19Z","email":"tazabreu@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tazabreu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-19T14:16:19Z","email":"tazabreu@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tazabreu"},"message":"feat: setup whitelabel ecosystem platform for AI-first engineering\n\nInitial platform setup with complete Docker containerization:\n\nPlatform Structure:\n- Whitelabel foundation for multiple products\n- Modern microservices architecture with DDD principles\n- Event-driven design with Kafka/Redpanda\n- Data mesh with Customer 360 lakehouse\n\nTechnology Stack:\n- Frontend: Next.js 14 + React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS\n- Backend: Spring Boot 3.2 (Java 21) + Express (TypeScript)\n- Data: PostgreSQL (per domain), DuckDB, dbt\n- Infrastructure: Docker, Docker Compose, Redpanda, OpenTelemetry\n\nKey Features:\n- Complete Docker containerization with health checks\n- Makefile with 30+ commands for easy management\n- End-to-end observability (journeyId, userEcosystemId)\n- Feature flag system\n- Demo credit card and user management products\n\nDocumentation:\n- GETTING_STARTED.md - Quick 2-minute start\n- DOCKER.md - Complete Docker reference\n- CHANGELOG.md - What changed and why\n- Comprehensive README.md with architecture overview\n\nQuick Start:\n`make up` - Start entire platform\n`open http://localhost:3000` - Access web app\nLogin: user:user or admin:admin\n\nThis is a learning platform for practicing AI-first development with cutting-edge technologies.","tree":{"sha":"190082bb27c8dff9ea099dcad524e69e46cff7e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tazabreu/whitelabel-ecosystem-platform/git/trees/190082bb27c8dff9ea099dcad524e69e46cff7e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tazabreu/whitelabel-ecosystem-platform/git/commits/086b02997b8911353e845cae52857df354198c79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_u