om/users/hyfdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyfdev","id":49502170,"login":"hyfdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTAyMTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/dac2db683f9ba269ae9cc975b0d73fa1283947f8","node_id":"C_kwDOQreA_9oAKGRhYzJkYjY4M2Y5YmEyNjlhZTljYzk3NWIwZDczZmExMjgzOTQ3Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/72ead1338d57d65228dcda5db569e54be498be95","sha":"72ead1338d57d65228dcda5db569e54be498be95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/72ead1338d57d65228dcda5db569e54be498be95"}],"sha":"dac2db683f9ba269ae9cc975b0d73fa1283947f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/dac2db683f9ba269ae9cc975b0d73fa1283947f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1430279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Boshen","id":1430279,"login":"Boshen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzAyNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/72ead1338d57d65228dcda5db569e54be498be95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T15:43:38Z","email":"boshenc@gmail.com","name":"Boshen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T15:43:38Z","email":"boshenc@gmail.com","name":"Boshen"},"message":"perf: replace TypedDashMap with TypedMap in CustomField (#8708)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Replace `TypedDashMap` (DashMap-backed, 64 shards × 8 KB = 512 KB per instance) with `TypedMap` (plain HashMap-backed) in `CustomField`\n- `CustomField` is write-once-read-many: populated at creation, wrapped in `Arc`, then only read — concurrent write access is never needed\n- Removes `dashmap` feature dependency from `typedmap` crate\n\n  Before (from earlier profiling):\n  - DashMap shard allocations from CustomField: ~24.2 MB in 3,104 blocks\n  - Total allocated: ~311 MB\n\n  After (with TypedMap):\n  - DashMap shard overhead (remaining, from other DashMaps like resolver/file emitter): 0.17 MB in ~17 blocks\n  - TypedMap/CustomField allocations: 0.15 MB\n  - Total allocated: 301.2 MB\n\n  The CustomField DashMap shard overhead dropped from ~24 MB to ~0.15 MB — a ~24 MB reduction (~99.4% elimination). The remaining 0.17 MB of\n  DashMap shard allocations come from other legitimate concurrent DashMaps (resolver cache, file emitter, etc.), not from CustomField.\n\n  The total allocation reduction of ~10 MB (311 → 301 MB) is less than the full 24 MB because this is a single-threaded dhat run (fewer shards\n  per DashMap than the 64-shard production scenario). The savings on a 10+ core production machine would be the full ~24 MB.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"63c2fd2c5ab9b2a3c1c38e6e38854003864bf3c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/63c2fd2c5ab9b2a3c1c38e6e38854003864bf3c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/72ead1338d57d65228dcda5db569e54be498be95","verification":{"payload":"tree 63c2fd2c5ab9b2a3c1c38e6e38854003864bf3c1\nparent 009639d211276366c1fc8b57615fa500afa12860\nauthor Boshen <boshenc@gmail.com> 1773589418 +0000\ncommitter Boshen <boshenc@gmail.com> 1773589418 +0000\n\nperf: replace TypedDashMap with TypedMap in CustomField (#8708)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Replace `TypedDashMap` (DashMap-backed, 64 shards × 8 KB = 512 KB per instance) with `TypedMap` (plain HashMap-backed) in `CustomField`\n- `CustomField` is write-once-read-many: populated at creation, wrapped in `Arc`, then only read — concurrent write access is never needed\n- Removes `dashmap` feature dependency from `typedmap` crate\n\n  Before (from earlier profiling):\n  - DashMap shard allocations from CustomField: ~24.2 MB in 3,104 blocks\n  - Total allocated: ~311 MB\n\n  After (with TypedMap):\n  - DashMap shard overhead (remaining, from other DashMaps like resolver/file emitter): 0.17 MB in ~17 blocks\n  - TypedMap/CustomField allocations: 0.15 MB\n  - Total allocated: 301.2 MB\n\n  The CustomField DashMap shard overhead dropped from ~24 MB to ~0.15 MB — a ~24 MB reduction (~99.4% elimination). The remaining 0.17 MB of\n  DashMap shard allocations come from other legitimate concurrent DashMaps (resolver cache, file emitter, etc.), not from CustomField.\n\n  The total allocation reduction of ~10 MB (311 → 301 MB) is less than the full 24 MB because this is a single-threaded dhat run (fewer shards\n  per DashMap than the 64-shard production scenario). The savings on a 10+ core production machine would be the full ~24 MB.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQTqOcrrb8tzCuydlodYsEgvslK9mQUCabbTqgAKCRBYsEgvslK9\nmWu1AP903zwMH72xHleXqwan3r0s11VPJlpOz4r1maBmP5eFWAD8DenJdfphv7Vv\nkHWzCXD9/068AJTf+LGrTjPl2lJmmgE=\n=goL1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T06:14:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1430279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Boshen","id":1430279,"login":"Boshen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzAyNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/72ead1338d57d65228dcda5db569e54be498be95","node_id":"C_kwDOQreA_9oAKDcyZWFkMTMzOGQ1N2Q2NTIyOGRjZGE1ZGI1NjllNTRiZTQ5OGJlOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/009639d211276366c1fc8b57615fa500afa12860","sha":"009639d211276366c1fc8b57615fa500afa12860","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/009639d211276366c1fc8b57615fa500afa12860"}],"sha":"72ead1338d57d65228dcda5db569e54be498be95","url":"https://api.github.com/repo