ttps://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IWANABETHATGUY","id":17974631,"login":"IWANABETHATGUY","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTc0NjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/03e35b361b68bd01aa3d292d439ecdf0bca35d6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T04:15:08Z","email":"iwanabethatguy@qq.com","name":"IWANABETHATGUY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T04:15:08Z","email":"iwanabethatguy@qq.com","name":"IWANABETHATGUY"},"message":"refactor: extract CJS bailout checks from include_symbol (#8683)\n\n` may_partial_namespace` leaked through recursive include_module calls, causing CJS exports to be incorrectly tree-shaken. Eliminates the error-prone mutable context\nflag entirely by extracting bailout checks into a standalone check_cjs_bailout function called explicitly at each include_symbol call site — partial namespace access (member\nexpressions with CJS targets) simply skips the call.","tree":{"sha":"d532ac1021236292a85fbf8738a55f42b7415890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/d532ac1021236292a85fbf8738a55f42b7415890"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/03e35b361b68bd01aa3d292d439ecdf0bca35d6e","verification":{"payload":"tree d532ac1021236292a85fbf8738a55f42b7415890\nparent 9efb810ff0fb1db1b5928a83e93685af6ef6df43\nauthor IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773548108 +0000\ncommitter IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773548108 +0000\n\nrefactor: extract CJS bailout checks from include_symbol (#8683)\n\n` may_partial_namespace` leaked through recursive include_module calls, causing CJS exports to be incorrectly tree-shaken. Eliminates the error-prone mutable context\nflag entirely by extracting bailout checks into a standalone check_cjs_bailout function called explicitly at each include_symbol call site — partial namespace access (member\nexpressions with CJS targets) simply skips the call.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQRqfUnLchu6/1mzDakLZAwGejhbGQUCabYyTAAKCRALZAwGejhb\nGYLZAQCf0EOw6pIjtxyC3YwdlMvpBXEC8vvdFRY6NETid3Ho2gD/ck1Bi1E/dM95\ngACGRmb0wu/suUn6mdfhZLdI7wUAIQY=\n=6Fmg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T06:14:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17974631?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IWANABETHATGUY","id":17974631,"login":"IWANABETHATGUY","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTc0NjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u