ail.com","name":"Boshen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T04:09:19Z","email":"boshenc@gmail.com","name":"Boshen"},"message":"fix: mark failing doctests as ignore (#8700)\n\n## Summary\n- Mark 4 doc tests as `ignore` that fail when running `cargo test --workspace` without `--lib --tests` flags\n- These doc tests reference functions/macros without proper imports (`strip_query`, `parse_srcset`, `parse_rel_attr`, `concat_string`)\n- This unblocks dropping `--lib --tests` from the CI cargo test command in a follow-up\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"e896138b37f5db57616b49705ae3b4c044ff12a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/e896138b37f5db57616b49705ae3b4c044ff12a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/9efb810ff0fb1db1b5928a83e93685af6ef6df43","verification":{"payload":"tree e896138b37f5db57616b49705ae3b4c044ff12a0\nparent 68f6274ea5370d4f324dd37dcbf0179b081a4d61\nauthor Boshen <boshenc@gmail.com> 1773547759 +0000\ncommitter Boshen <boshenc@gmail.com> 1773547759 +0000\n\nfix: mark failing doctests as ignore (#8700)\n\n## Summary\n- Mark 4 doc tests as `ignore` that fail when running `cargo test --workspace` without `--lib --tests` flags\n- These doc tests reference functions/macros without proper imports (`strip_query`, `parse_srcset`, `parse_rel_attr`, `concat_string`)\n- This unblocks dropping `--lib --tests` from the CI cargo test command in a follow-up\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQTqOcrrb8tzCuydlodYsEgvslK9mQUCabYw7wAKCRBYsEgvslK9\nmSv4AP402j2vIrJAC0ja2214G1ln/iNoqtEPvdJ46LMztvIGxQEA22+H+QAogPuj\n8nKkzejmzFrOiotDhZbPoNd5PLbbfwY=\n=cBpB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T06:14:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercont