75811e082f04c49d8dfd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T15:54:53Z","email":"boshenc@gmail.com","name":"Boshen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T15:54:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(bench): remove scan benchmark binary to halve LTO link time (#8694)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Remove the redundant `scan` benchmark binary — since `bundle` (which\ncalls `generate()`) already includes scanning, it was duplicating work\n- Each benchmark binary triggers a separate fat LTO link pass (~57s\nlocally, ~7-8 min on CI), so removing one binary cuts that cost in half\n- Rename `bundle.rs` → `bench.rs` and consolidate to a single\n`[[bench]]` entry in Cargo.toml\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bded3cd3c69638ebefc5653ea7e8a96d4c7f0095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/bded3cd3c69638ebefc5653ea7e8a96d4c7f0095"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/e0886764937bebc498ba75811e082f04c49d8dfd","verification":{"payload":"tree bded3cd3c69638ebefc5653ea7e8a96d4c7f0095\nparent 733c70dba6bf388d13930d0bd867273b057aab81\nauthor Boshen <boshenc@gmail.com> 1773503693 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773503693 +0800\n\nperf(bench): remove scan benchmark binary to halve LTO link time (#8694)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Remove the redundant `scan` benchmark binary — since `bundle` (which\ncalls `generate()`) already includes scanning, it was duplicating work\n- Each benchmark binary triggers a separate fat LTO link pass (~57s\nlocally, ~7-8 min on CI), so removing one binary cuts that cost in half\n- Rename `bundle.rs` → `bench.rs` and consolidate to a single\n`[[bench]]` entry in Cargo.toml\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <n