rtial_namespace from leaking through include_module (#8682)\n\nFixes #8675\nwhere CJS module exports were incorrectly tree-shaken when an ESM module had both a namespace import (`import * as React from ''./react.cjs''`) and a default import (`import\ncreateStyled from ''./createStyled.cjs''`). The may_partial_namespace flag leaked through recursive include_module calls, causing the second CJS module''s bailout check to be skipped.\nThe fix saves and resets the flag at include_module boundaries.","tree":{"sha":"f7a1fc2205431efe6d52952903c29318032401ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/f7a1fc2205431efe6d52952903c29318032401ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/733c70dba6bf388d13930d0bd867273b057aab81","verification":{"payload":"tree f7a1fc2205431efe6d52952903c29318032401ed\nparent a532de949671df25de1252dfc807c73e95c17f3b\nauthor IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773502996 +0000\ncommitter IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773502996 +0000\n\nfix: prevent may_partial_namespace from leaking through include_module (#8682)\n\nFixes #8675\nwhere CJS module exports were incorrectly tree-shaken when an ESM module had both a namespace import (`import * as React from ''./react.cjs''`) and a default import (`import\ncreateStyled from ''./createStyled.cjs''`). The may_partial_namespace flag leaked through recursive include_module calls, causing the second CJS module''s bailout check to be skipped.\nThe fix saves and resets the flag at include_module boundaries.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQRqfUnLchu6/1mzDakLZAwGejhbGQUCabWCFAAKCRALZAwGejhb\nGc9eAP0adqx6qA5lDAbRv+TNyYYGU6R1JdveQNbShStTeQ0lywD/TrudGe50aATs\nTh5rYAkT4mw2BF3fqVICeSU8yXzLGAc=\n=TUzj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T06:14:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17974631