803f26"}],"sha":"7b8c6eeff58078fc8f9c9e879d6bbc577ffac2f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/7b8c6eeff58078fc8f9c9e879d6bbc577ffac2f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29533304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Dunqing","id":29533304,"login":"Dunqing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTMzMzA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dunqing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/38b736901333687d5e2065314104358d78803f26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T03:00:15Z","email":"dengqing0821@gmail.com","name":"Dunqing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T03:00:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(rust): filter external modules from entries instead of mapping bit positions (#8637)\n\n## Summary\n\nFollow-up to #8596. Instead of using `bit_to_chunk_idx` to map bit\npositions to chunk indices (a band-aid that every consumer must\nremember), this filters external modules at the source so they never get\nentry bit positions.\n\n- **`module_loader.rs`**: Skip external modules when collecting\n`dynamic_import_entry_ids`\n- **`chunk_graph.rs`**: Remove `bit_to_chunk_idx` field\n- **`code_splitting.rs`**: Remove `bit_to_chunk_idx`\npre-allocation/recording, add `debug_assert` for entry module normality\n- **`chunk_optimizer.rs`**: Use direct `ChunkIdx::from_raw(bit)` instead\nof `bit_to_chunk_idx` lookup\n- **`code-splitting.md`**: Update design doc to reflect new approach\n\nThis matches esbuild''s approach where external modules never enter the\nentry list, ensuring bit positions directly equal chunk indices.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `cargo test -p rolldown --test integration -- \"8595\"` passes\n- [x] `cargo test -p rolldown --test integration --\n\"circular_chunk_from_external\"` passes\n- [ ] Full CI\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: autofix-ci[bot] <114827586+autofix-ci[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8bbea5647d30d3bebb80b315ddc1c54bdd05dd34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/8bbea5647d30d3bebb80b315ddc1c54bdd05dd34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/38b736901333687d5e2065314104358d78803f26","verification":{"payload":"tree 8bbea5647d30d3bebb80b315ddc1c54bdd05dd34\nparent 0dc283cd7e58a3df49e1b04ffaa46f209e21aab7\nauthor Dunqing <dengqing0821@gmail.com> 1773370815 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773370815 +0800\n\nrefactor(rust): filter external modules from entries instead of mapping bit positions (#8637)\n\n## Summary\n\nFollow-up to #8596. Instead of using `bit_to_chunk_idx` to map bit\npositions to chunk indices (a band-aid that every consumer must\nremember), this filters external modules at the source so they never get\nentry bit positions.\n\n- **`module_loader.rs`**: Skip external modules when collecting\n`dynamic_import_entry_ids`\n- **`chunk_graph.rs`**: Remove `bit_to_chunk_idx` field\n- **`code_splitting.rs`**: Remove `bit_to_chunk_idx`\npre-allocation/recording, add `debug_assert` for entry module normality\n- **`chunk_optimizer.rs`**: Use direct `ChunkIdx::from_raw(bit)` instead\nof `bit_to_chunk_idx` lookup\n- **`code-splitting.md`**: Update design doc to reflect new approach\n\nThis matches esbuild''s approach where external modules never enter the\nentry list, ensuring bit positions directly equal chunk indices.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `cargo test -p rolldown --test integration -- \"8595\"` passes\n- [x] `cargo test -p rolldown --test integration --\n\"circular_chunk_from_external\"` passes\n- [ ] Full CI\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: autofix-ci[bot] <114827586+autofix-ci[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJps32/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAISIQAFBo4C5x5td5FjilWi+2fHuv\nBVvqWr8gmXlfFjK6Q9lpTsL6E8tX9jVs2J4Ur84etDepqW1dHC6ihO7y4HBsdkL9\nIqBy9pqOFRfOFj/VyvXgL10xu5Df9TRGXHvQclrq0YfkBeHcLUGGe2zwtYHN6oUp\nictxcKLOrB2sIT3RaD0wguMZ6BUJSvpriTDvG8YsiRiYMpk2w3YtAnmAWHq29Ec2\nSvbNz9b0NHFpqM9SugaHlSlo+PH0Fq8j9f+ZYqn2PFxGh4ANLg5YF1KzmJZW6E4X\nbIl6EolYYPXmDj4+tPZfBIqMPJCZzJzyN1guXerVyWsxCpqDO8o7CotLFl9ENVh2\nXJs7iVceM/SP6fSLN+4yLiVTIVum+aeM2waLnebPP52POPOJzBGwgJiVDJRuIEMc\ngAys03tLEl405P6o9hfkOcOFgLyIi2p/GqPqnQ2IBfaRb7Jb9tLNf6WZX9i/0Q3c\nDMcMuGg1WvpCorJA8CUURfArjk9fKMVHjoGx7Ya+mLKU6Pxq9eZz6RMAnHNzD2CK\n7Sum+BEiSyN4GiHivsnC7w2a0qao7PFk5vlZDc4y2ET8W0OqBMCZ8VtjNr96oYt5\nZwQwg1tUjVQatCfxN1qinJzsDXqSAXplgs16uOk2PfpPkz61Rk1Le5eBEEEiVNA/\nLp83sJ5a/sW6GRVzYIQz\n=o2kD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T06:14:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.