:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T14:05:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(rust): make bundler generic over FileSystem for in-memory benchmarks (#8652)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Propagate `Fs: FileSystem` type parameter through the bundler pipeline\n(`TaskContext` → `ModuleLoader` → `ScanStage` → `Bundle`) so benchmarks\ncan inject a `MemoryFileSystem`, eliminating disk I/O noise from\nmeasurements\n- Add `BundleFactory::create_bundle_with_fs()` for injecting custom\nFS/resolver pairs\n- Update benchmarks to preload source files into `MemoryFileSystem`\noutside the timed loop\n\nThe public API (`Bundler`, `BundlerBuilder`) remains unchanged — all\ngeneric structs use `= OsFileSystem` defaults.\n\nCloses #8642\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: autofix-ci[bot] <114827586+autofix-ci[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"42b5a61bf8b3c9f411d9be5626c5c4eb63e2799d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/42b5a61bf8b3c9f411d9be5626c5c4eb63e2799d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/91ca4eac10fe2b4f627beb0fcc5b534acc60b674","verification":{"payload":"tree 42b5a61bf8b3c9f411d9be5626c5c4eb63e2799d\nparent 9710def1540554e715307e7912f943b67f653748\nauthor Boshen <boshenc@gmail.com> 1773324300 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773324300 +0800\n\nfeat(rust): make bundler generic over FileSystem for in-memory benchmarks (#8652)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Propagate `Fs: FileSystem` type parameter through the bundler pipeline\n(`TaskContext` → `ModuleLoader` → `ScanStage` → `Bundle`) so benchmarks\ncan inject a `MemoryFileSystem`, eliminating disk I/O noise from\nmeasurements\n- Add `BundleFactory::create_bundle_with_fs()` for injecting custom\nFS/resolver pairs\n- Update benchmarks to preload source files into `MemoryFileSystem`\noutside the timed loop\n\nThe public API (`Bundler`, `BundlerBuilder`) remains unchanged — all\ngeneric structs use `= OsFileSystem` defaults.\n\nCloses #8642\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: autofix-ci[bot] <114827586+autofix-ci[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpssgMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3mYQAA6PvCWoqblxMXbvNV6iVvYe\neWcZwP9C81h4/eDfKr2g6t8Aade0hCNO4Ea7ywutr20vKSqIzP51mVUMUFCVUDAw\n8vMQ0D5Lt+EyJ1weOlqbMv0XC/EQTz48StJM7XjK9S3ptC60FU9EWXOy+Es+hsAL\nIkpBtgFnTb7ugymmi4OxyfNhNH3Kmo4HDqlbauW3F5Gdo0aHVu5VNDjw/qOfM847\nS2+sobAmy4eh6rLapwaimyTh8JImTVUCOQDttzavH6txGU024pLR6qByDErIXcR4\nOMQZfzXjaloduMuMn7A7ay06py62bTBm5gIRawDBNB5BJ/nEoBNF/txtldtukyT5\nKxMKM8kFpRFIQnhWoko5g93HdSxEZ2nWVLo1icFxVe8d/HYE+PMT8hf/XF6QTgV5\nNZIg1yfNIc3z1S4Z/xQ4Bt8D+cB0bn5nNPiDmRy/ED17tr2d6sp8b1OciIFfqo7E\nW6wj7NFRdV5aJog99JP9d0UZUSpAg2x+wbwWPIOs7RskCWdCQMUlBV54G7hsPvWv\nvE6zM5O4+zzmQqUUik+P//0RqtEn/lQVjHJas+vAKNyOEh/+fIUqjh0hQLUXQvJQ\nl0dAinZQEbzAaWY8MHzzYicEwjpHOn7hhS+5VNUL3poooh1p+q7loBiywiveB5ug\nvKx2ex3NEAD9/x2uP235\n=LoTa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T06:14:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/91ca4eac10fe2b4f627beb0fcc5b534acc60b674","node_id":"C_kwDOQreA_9oAKDkxY2E0ZWFjMTBmZTJiNGY2MjdiZWIwZmNjNWI1MzRhY2M2MGI2NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/9710def1540554e715307e7912f943b67f653748","sha":"9710def1540554e715307e7912f943b67f653748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/9710def1540554e715307e7912f943b67f653748"}],"sha":"91ca4eac10fe2b4f627beb0fcc5b534acc60b674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/91ca4eac10fe2b4f627beb0fcc5b534acc60b674"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17974631?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IWANABETHATGUY","id":17974631,"login":"IWANABETHATGUY","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTc0NjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/9710def1540554e715307e7912f943b67f653748/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-12T13:02:09Z","email":"iwanabethatguy@qq.com","name":"IWANABETHATGUY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T13:02:09Z","email":"iwanabethatguy@qq.com","name":"IWANABETHATGUY"},"message":"fix: validate filenames for NUL bytes from chunkFileNames/entryFileNames (#8644)\n\nWhen a `chunkFileNames`/`entryFileNames` callback uses virtual module IDs (prefixed with `\\0`) directly in the returned filename, rolldown previously crashed with an `UNHANDLEABLE_ERROR` when trying to write the file. This adds validation in `FilenameTemplate::render()` to detect NUL bytes in the rendered filename and return a clear `BuildDiagnostic` error instead.\n\nThis matches Rollup''s behavior where the same scenario produces a clean error from Node.js. Rollup keeps `\\0` in [`moduleIds`/`facadeModuleId`](https://github.com/rollup/rollup/blob/ae846957f/src/Chunk.ts#L1130-L1144) as-is — `\\0` is an internal convention for virtual modules. Rollup''s [`sanitizeFileName`](https://github.com/rollup/rollup/blob/ae846957f/src/utils/sanitizeFileName.ts#L3) (which replaces `\\u0000-\\u001F` with `_`) is only applied to [chunk names](https://github.com/rollup/rollup/blob/ae846957f/src/Chunk.ts#L558) used for the `[name]` pattern, not to [callback return values](https://github.com/rollup/rollup/blob/ae846957f/src/Chunk.ts#L594-L604).\n\nThis is how rollup behaves on newly added tests.\n\n<img width=\"1204\" height=\"307\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27546356-c281-47d1-95e0-268a5c766717\" />\n\nRollup doesn''t validate or strip `\\0` from the callback result — it passes it straight through to the filesystem, and Node.js throws the error.\n\nOur fix is actually **better** than Rollup''s behavior: we catch the NUL byte before it reaches the filesystem and provide a helpful error message explaining virtual module IDs and how to fix it, rather than letting it bubble up as a cryptic Node.js `TypeError`.\n\nclosed #8627","tree":{"sha":"ab971657c514f295f42041cf529eb34cf2265b83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/ab971657c514f295f42041cf529eb34cf2265b83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/9710def1540554e715307e7912f943b67f653748","verification":{"payload":"tree ab971657c514f295f42041cf529eb34cf2265b83\nparent 4a9e9b34be8d7da51ab107aaadbc5ad6fbf71e2f\nauthor IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773320529 +0000\ncommitter IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773320529 +0000\n\nfix: validate filenames for NUL bytes from chunkFileNames/entryFileNames (#8644)\n\nWhen a `chunkFileNames`/`entryFileNames` callback uses virtual module IDs (prefixed with `\\0`) directly in the returned filename, rolldown previously crashed with an `UNHANDLEABLE_ERROR` when trying to write the file. This adds validation in `FilenameTemplate::render()` to detect NUL bytes in the rendered filename and return a clear `BuildDiagnostic` error instead.\n\nThis matches Rollup''s behavior where the same scenario produces a clean error from Node.js. Rollup keeps `\\0` in [`moduleIds`/`facadeModuleId`](https://github.com/rollup/rollup/blob/ae846957f/src/Chunk.ts#L1130-L1144) as-is — `\\0` is an internal convention for virtual modules. Rollup''s [`sanitizeFileName`](https://github.com/rollup/rollup/blob/ae846957f/src/utils/sanitizeFileName.ts#L3) (which replaces `\\u0000-\\u001F` with `_`) is only applied to [chunk names](https://github.com/rollup/rollup/blob/ae846957f/src/Chunk.ts#L558) used for the `[name]` pattern, not to [callback return values](https://github.com/rollup/rollup/blob/ae846957f/src/Chunk.ts#L594-L604).\n\nThis is how rollup behaves on newly added tests.\n\n<img width=\"1204\" height=\"307\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27546356-c281-47d1-95e0-268a5c766717\" />\n\nRollup doesn''t validate or strip `\\0` from the callback result — it passes it straight through to the filesystem, and Node.js throws the error.\n\nOur fix is actually **better** than Rollup''s behavior: we catch the NUL byte before it reaches the filesystem and provide a helpful error message explaining virtual module IDs and how to fix it, rather than letting it bubble up as a cryptic Node.js `TypeError`.\n\nclosed #8627\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQRqfUnLchu6/1mzDakLZAwGejhbGQUCabK5UQAKCRALZAwGejhb\nGW+mAQCSlJo5vfCygC3Am08MIxn3oF/MsyOvNkUs/ATbtOnN8wD+Oh9UW/z8U/pe\nx/VjeNHuI6BVsO4sekJPW3atFcg5BAM=\n=F2b7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T06:14:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17974631?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IWANABETHATGUY","id":17974631,"login":"IWANABETHATGUY","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTc0NjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/9710def1540554e715307e7912f943b67f653748","node_id":"C_kwDOQreA_9oAKDk3MTBkZWYxNTQwNTU0ZTcxNTMwN2U3OTEyZjk0M2I2N2Y2NTM3NDg","pa