ult) was implicitly setting `process.env.NODE_ENV` to `''production''` for browser builds. This replaces `is_enabled()` with a new `is_production()` check that only returns true for full minification modes (`Bool(true)` or `Object`), so `dce-only` now correctly defaults to `''development''`. Fixes #8618.","tree":{"sha":"32ba0b8b38b467aa331a543d8003e329f05239aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/32ba0b8b38b467aa331a543d8003e329f05239aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/4a9e9b34be8d7da51ab107aaadbc5ad6fbf71e2f","verification":{"payload":"tree 32ba0b8b38b467aa331a543d8003e329f05239aa\nparent 16de9b5f8087279c5d661a59dd59dff8d09f417b\nauthor IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773308096 +0000\ncommitter IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773308097 +0000\n\nfix: dce-only minify should not set NODE_ENV to production (#8651)\n\n`minify: ''dce-only''` (the default) was implicitly setting `process.env.NODE_ENV` to `''production''` for browser builds. This replaces `is_enabled()` with a new `is_production()` check that only returns true for full minification modes (`Bool(true)` or `Object`), so `dce-only` now correctly defaults to `''development''`. Fixes #8618.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQRqfUnLchu6/1mzDakLZAwGejhbGQUCabKIwQAKCRALZAwGejhb\nGc37AP9p8HTP0mWqZaG4e0Mu86AOYy8GG2dDReL6fklspQ0KOAD/awTZS49dYKhO\nehgMcFPhVA0pubQ1OkJxiwhrGioumQ4=\n=BsgV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T06:14:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17974631?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/gists{/gi