repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/f84f2ce3f7b4edb78b6c3204db2f604fea700e57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T16:09:39Z","email":"iwanabethatguy@qq.com","name":"IWANABETHATGUY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T16:09:39Z","email":"iwanabethatguy@qq.com","name":"IWANABETHATGUY"},"message":"refactor!: rename exported BindingMagicString to RolldownMagicString (#8626)\n\nfrom https://github.com/rolldown/rolldown/pull/8614#discussion_r2911804160\n## Summary\n\n Rename the exported `BindingMagicString` class to `RolldownMagicString` in the public API.\n\n Only the exported name is changed — internal TypeScript code continues to use `BindingMagicString` to keep naming consistent with the binding layer. The public rename aligns the class name with its detection flag `isRolldownMagicString` (introduced in #8614).\n\n ## Changes\n - Update the re-export in `packages/rolldown/src/index.ts`\n - Update test imports to use the new name","tree":{"sha":"9361f5c10160086493ea5319829532b74c4be6f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/9361f5c10160086493ea5319829532b74c4be6f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/f84f2ce3f7b4edb78b6c3204db2f604fea700e57","verification":{"payload":"tree 9361f5c10160086493ea5319829532b74c4be6f6\nparent 610df552f931a26022868fd63079ea231f2f1814\nauthor IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773158979 +0000\ncommitter IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773158979 +0000\n\nrefactor!: rename exported BindingMagicString to RolldownMagicString (#8626)\n\nfrom https://github.com/rolldown/rolldown/pull/8614#discussion_r2911804160\n## Summary\n\n Rename the exported `BindingMagicString` class to `RolldownMagicString` in the public API.\n\n Only the exported name is changed — internal TypeScript code continues to use `BindingMagicString` to keep naming consistent with the binding layer. The public