ved_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/b08184ef5fd6119de3b5b4c898438e61b58f7aac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T14:55:16Z","email":"iwanabethatguy@qq.com","name":"IWANABETHATGUY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T14:55:16Z","email":"iwanabethatguy@qq.com","name":"IWANABETHATGUY"},"message":"feat(rolldown): add isRolldownMagicString property for reliable native detection (#8614)\n\n## Summary\n\nExternal packages like `rolldown-string` need to detect native `BindingMagicString` instances, but the existing `obj.constructor.name` check breaks under minification or bundling. This PR adds a reliable `isRolldownMagicString` boolean property to the `BindingMagicString` prototype via `Object.defineProperty` (non-writable, non-configurable). A new `binding-magic-string.ts` module centralizes the patching and re-exports the class with proper TypeScript typings. All internal imports now go through this module to ensure consistency. Tests cover prototype presence, instance access, and detection without importing rolldown.\n\n## Related\n\nhttps://github.com/rolldown/rolldown/issues/7522\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"3602ec08f34ac944fee067319e44d389121163aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/3602ec08f34ac944fee067319e44d389121163aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/b08184ef5fd6119de3b5b4c898438e61b58f7aac","verification":{"payload":"tree 3602ec08f34ac944fee067319e44d389121163aa\nparent d88eb83737fbfbb9cdbab2ba440e73d09494ce6e\nauthor IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773154516 +0000\ncommitter IWANABETHATGUY <iwanabethatguy@qq.com> 1773154516 +0000\n\nfeat(rolldown): add isRolldownMagicString property for reliable native detection (#8614)\n\n## Summary\n\nExternal packages like `rolldown-string` need to detect native `BindingMagicString` instances, but the existing `obj.constructor.name` check breaks under minification or bundling. This PR adds a reliable `isRolldownMagicString` boolean property to the `BindingMagicString` prototype via `Object.defineProperty` (non-writable, non-configurable). A new `binding-magic-string.ts` module centralizes the patching and re-exports the class with proper TypeScript typings. All internal imports now go through this module to ensure consistency. Tests cover prototype presence, instance access, and detection without importing rolldown.\n\n## Related\n\nhttps://github.com/rolldown/rolldown/issues/7522\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQRqfUnLchu6/1mzDakLZAwGejhbGQUCabAw1AAKCRALZAwGejhb\nGcQvAQCI1kPR/sflEbYNFxNu9ZBbKwibXY/iXWmOr3WNX6MtVQEAmoViBpsMf58U\nvPAuUF7usAWoCyYmLWmQo/ALEAzFkQA=\n=ugm0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-12T08:09:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17974631?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IWANABETHATGUY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IWANABETHATGUY","id":17974631,"login":"IWANABETHATGUY","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTc0NjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.git