blic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/b821838b186f1b5e58dc214b05b0b8d950b10874/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T10:05:23Z","email":"andywangsy@gmail.com","name":"h-a-n-a"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T10:05:23Z","email":"andywangsy@gmail.com","name":"h-a-n-a"},"message":"build: fix early exit in script build-node (#8617)\n\nWhen debugging rolldown, script `build-node` sometimes exit earlier than `build-types-check` , causing an issue where dts checks are not able to pass. Claude helps me find an issue related to an early exit issue in oxnode. In this PR, I temprarily replaced the script with direct invocation of `@oxc-node/core` to fix the issue.\nI''ve created an issue at https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc-node/issues/493\n\nNote: I''ve just changed the script that affects my workflow and kept the others as-is.","tree":{"sha":"3044c4f2efd17b1d2113da822a2b325bbeac509d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/3044c4f2efd17b1d2113da822a2b325bbeac509d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/b821838b186f1b5e58dc214b05b0b8d950b10874","verification":{"payload":"tree 3044c4f2efd17b1d2113da822a2b325bbeac509d\nparent 41e79833120976c81491189b969b4425d083e6bc\nauthor h-a-n-a <andywangsy@gmail.com> 1773137123 +0000\ncommitter h-a-n-a <andywangsy@gmail.com> 1773137123 +0000\n\nbuild: fix early exit in script build-node (#8617)\n\nWhen debugging rolldown, script `build-node` sometimes exit earlier than `build-types-check` , causing an issue where dts checks are not able to pass. Claude helps me find an issue related to an early exit issue in oxnode. In this PR, I temprarily replaced the script with direct invocation of `@oxc-node/core` to fix the issue.\nI''ve created an issue at https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc-node/issues/493\n\nNote: I''ve just changed the script that 