/github.com/Boshen","id":1430279,"login":"Boshen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzAyNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/d03e11ac0357b9253aae601ac22c889ad793eace/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T04:27:45Z","email":"boshenc@gmail.com","name":"Boshen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T04:27:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf: merge 4 integration test binaries into 1 (#8610)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Consolidates `integration_esbuild`, `integration_rolldown`,\n`integration_rollup`, and `integration_test262` into a single\n`integration` test binary via `tests/integration/main.rs`\n- Eliminates 3 redundant ~80MB link steps on every incremental build\n(~240MB saved)\n- All 1704 tests continue to pass and can still be filtered (e.g. `cargo\ntest --test integration -- esbuild`)\n\n## Details\n\nThe `tests/rolldown/` directory stays in place (it contains both Rust\nmodules and fixture data with intentionally broken syntax). The\nintegration binary references it via `#[path = \"../rolldown/mod.rs\"] mod\nrolldown_tests;` to avoid both moving thousands of fixture files and\nshadowing the external `rolldown` crate name.\n\nA `dunce::canonicalize` call was added to\n`IntegrationTestBuilder::new()` to resolve `..` path segments that\n`file!()` produces when modules are loaded via `#[path]` attributes —\nthis fixes HMR watch file path matching.\n\n## Measurements\n\n### Local incremental build (touch `lib.rs`, rebuild tests)\n\n| Metric | Old (4 binaries) | New (1 binary) | Savings |\n|--------|-----------------|----------------|---------|\n| Wall time | 4.47s | 3.73s | **-17%** |\n| CPU time | 12.42s | 6.48s | **-48%** |\n| Binaries linked | 4 (78+79+76+64 = 297MB) | 1 (82MB) | **-215MB disk**\n|\n\n### CI (ubuntu-latest)\n\n| Step | Old (main, 4 binaries) | New (PR, 1 binary) | Savings |\n|------|----------------------|-------------------|---------|\n| Build | 51s | 47s | -4s |\n| Run Test | 86s | 87s | ~same |\n| Total | 137s | 134s | -3s |\n\nCI savings are modest since the build step is cached. The main win is\n**local incremental builds** — 48% less CPU work and 215MB less disk per\nbuild cycle.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Boshen <boshenc@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: autofix-ci[bot] <114827586+autofix-ci[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5133a289aecf0a570e915152e9f2b04b3bfd439d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/5133a289aecf0a570e915152e9f2b04b3bfd439d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/d03e11ac0357b9253aae601ac22c889ad793eace","verification":{"payload":"tree 5133a289aecf0a570e915152e9f2b04b3bfd439d\nparent be73ffc8bd638cef179143fd949c97fefa3335fe\nauthor Boshen <boshenc@gmail.com> 1773116865 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773116865 +0800\n\nperf: merge 4 integration test binaries into 1 (#8610)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Consolidates `integration_esbuild`, `integration_rolldown`,\n`integration_rollup`, and `integration_test262` into a single\n`integration` test binary via `tests/integration/main.rs`\n- Eliminates 3 redundant ~80MB link steps on every incremental build\n(~240MB saved)\n- All 1704 tests continue to pass and can still be filtered (e.g. `cargo\ntest --test integration -- esbuild`)\n\n## Details\n\nThe `tests/rolldown/` directory stays in place (it contains both Rust\nmodules and fixture data with intentionally broken syntax). The\nintegration binary references it via `#[path = \"../rolldown/mod.rs\"] mod\nrolldown_tests;` to avoid both moving thousands of fixture files and\nshadowing the external `rolldown` crate name.\n\nA `dunce::canonicalize` call was added to\n`IntegrationTestBuilder::new()` to resolve `..` path segments that\n`file!()` produces when modules are loaded via `#[path]` attributes —\nthis fixes HMR watch file path matching.\n\n## Measurements\n\n### Local incremental build (touch `lib.rs`, rebuild tests)\n\n| Metric | Old (4 binaries) | New (1 binary) | Savings |\n|--------|-----------------|----------------|---------|\n| Wall time | 4.47s | 3.73s | **-17%** |\n| CPU time | 12.42s | 6.48s | **-48%** |\n| Binaries linked | 4 (78+79+76+64 = 297MB) | 1 (82MB) | **-215MB disk**\n|\n\n### CI (ubuntu-latest)\n\n| Step | Old (main, 4 binaries) | New (PR, 1 binary) | Savings |\n|------|----------------------|-------------------|---------|\n| Build | 51s | 47s | -4s |\n| Run Test | 86s | 87s | ~same |\n| Total | 137s | 134s | -3s |\n\nCI savings are modest since the build step is cached. The main win is\n**local incremental builds** — 48% less CPU work and 215MB less disk per\nbuild cycle.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Boshen <boshenc@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: autofix-ci[bot] <114827586+autofix-ci[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpr53BCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIHUQAKLN4gLErdhs9qwicQ3SWkR8\n3Q9q+xmIDljwfcuQdGLLYiZ4JnUtjc9kUwde2ZROt4xCm5V7VxqvoiaMZWrmRN8Q\niOmjnqh3CQ3TC1M4O8tMthHeFrSNZooHkk5BxACwOg/I/2FhVEf7ppgZplx6fmFl\n/vliu8fQNXizIT8Mi7U