/api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/8fc59f6eaeb3258964cf49610757c53ca56cc8a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T15:54:55Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Copilot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T15:54:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: skip macOS CI jobs on pull requests (#8608)\n\nThis extends the CI policy from #8600 to macOS: PRs now run Ubuntu-only\nfor the affected CI lanes, while macOS and Windows remain enabled on\n`main`.\n\n- **Cargo test matrix**\n  - Make the `cargo-test` platform matrix explicit:\n    - `main`: `ubuntu-latest`, `macos-latest`, `windows-latest`\n    - PRs / non-`main`: `ubuntu-latest` only\n\n- **macOS native build gating**\n  - Gate `build-rolldown-macos` behind `github.ref_name == ''main''`\n\n- **macOS Node job gating**\n  - Gate `node-test-macos` behind `github.ref_name == ''main''`\n  - Gate `node-dev-server-test-macos` behind `github.ref_name == ''main''`\n\n- **Workflow shape**\n  - Keep Ubuntu PR coverage unchanged\n- Mirror the existing Windows-on-`main` behavior instead of introducing\na separate policy path\n\n```yml\nstrategy:\n  matrix:\n    target: ${{ github.ref_name == ''main''\n      && fromJSON(''[\"ubuntu-latest\",\"macos-latest\",\"windows-latest\"]'')\n      || fromJSON(''[\"ubuntu-latest\"]'') }}\n```\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT TIPS -->\n---\n\n✨ Let Copilot coding agent [set things up for\nyou](https://github.com/rolldown/rolldown/issues/new?title=✨+Set+up+Copilot+instructions&body=Configure%20instructions%20for%20this%20repository%20as%20documented%20in%20%5BBest%20practices%20for%20Copilot%20coding%20agent%20in%20your%20repository%5D%28https://gh.io/copilot-coding-agent-tips%29%2E%0A%0A%3COnboard%20this%20repo%3E&assignees=copilot)\n— coding agent works faster and does higher quality work when set up for\nyour repo.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: hyf0 <49502170+hyf0@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"acab21ee0c529864c2c28ac3d1b683e3bb05960b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/acab21ee0c529864c2c28ac3d1b683e3bb05960b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/8fc59f6eaeb3258964cf49610757c53ca56cc8a6","verification":{"payload":"tree acab21ee0c529864c2c28ac3d1b683e3bb05960b\nparent cfddd82f27edd237d2ffc241418328d90784090c\nauthor Copilot <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com> 1773071695 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773071695 +0800\n\nci: skip macOS CI jobs on pull requests (#8608)\n\nThis extends the CI policy from #8600 to macOS: PRs now run Ubuntu-only\nfor the affected CI lanes, while macOS and Windows remain enabled on\n`main`.\n\n- **Cargo test matrix**\n  - Make the `cargo-test` platform matrix explicit:\n    - `main`: `ubuntu-latest`, `macos-latest`, `windows-latest`\n    - PRs / non-`main`: `ubuntu-latest` only\n\n- **macOS native build gating**\n  - Gate `build-rolldown-macos` behind `github.ref_name == ''main''`\n\n- **macOS Node job gating**\n  - Gate `node-test-macos` behind `github.ref_name == ''main''`\n  - Gate `node-dev-server-test-macos` behind `github.ref_name == ''main''`\n\n- **Workflow shape**\n  - Keep Ubuntu PR coverage unchanged\n- Mirror the existing Windows-on-`main` behavior instead of introducing\na separate policy path\n\n```yml\nstrategy:\n  matrix:\n    target: ${{ github.ref_name == ''main''\n      && fromJSON(''[\"ubuntu-latest\",\"macos-latest\",\"windows-latest\"]'')\n      || fromJSON(''[\"ubuntu-latest\"]'') }}\n```\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT TIPS -->\n---\n\n✨ Let Copilot coding agent [set things up for\nyou](https://github.com/rolldown/rolldown/issues/new?title=✨+Set+up+Copilot+instructions&body=Configure%20instructions%20for%20this%20repository%20as%20documented%20in%20%5BBest%20practices%20for%20Copilot%20coding%20agent%20in%20your%20repository%5D%28https://gh.io/copilot-coding-agent-tips%29%2E%0A%0A%3COnboard%20this%20repo%3E&assignees=copilot)\n— coding agent works faster and does higher quality work when set up for\nyour repo.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: hyf0 <49502170+hyf0@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpru1PCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALyUQAKqwHLb3mOCuq8ABVgFn9NJ1\n9hX91QfXnsPxiqG2acnjhUbUcsTuWDKCOHRYkLbV4Gho00TJfhGJFfwt7s5Z31eG\ntnWLoVeVkYmSo6Fal/CFY/nG1lqoVjl3PJmUKZz1AiyTIwWfz1WASfolz5OIEsgC\nwEz6fjzQRSZfbBZB8EOd+FrgK5DJmJN0LaVTKL0rB8MlLXtncqJ2s4HNvh/Or9AN\nLStz/ilv4ArjNHAi+ZNxuDaeB2s4XJoU7RPjBY7KNqvg9GDQDFmDZQG7+pfEgAda\nUPVoRZrBdwoYZT1ztwIvG83o58e0mAwxSVWGABlpmEd04Mg1MnHJ8LtTm+pzKg0Z\nnf3QohIU3kR0g5TQ3RwQUi2vI/CYPLAO9OkKhiwTYxhWYhLGddI8rrQuo3rTVuvu\nsAI/gV0fLbeo5iFGKj7I6SShsHV0P6ZzfozwIQLVw9qS3NhWn7f+R2SKNKUyQJ1L\nZrDM3fBysFWS0rqBQhPrKHZWCDUjRzbBHBurFN9/8wWpDbTt7sTEHJlzKDYoxZaY\nZXtGufxlOKaZ2xTnFFWAv7VaEz6zx8cpSJCP7h19HiMlasYNL2dGISXfD1mvpppo\n6fHD+jP7YpD0dKKRse1C9N+q0amKysmlbXkphB4gIRb1wuNtroTdQmRGIes2S2pD\nSDJL9+gUfVEVp2NH6798\n=Y4rx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-10T07:34:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","foll