-08T05:14:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(devtools): trace dynamic imports in devtools (#8581)\n\nFixes #8549.\n\n## Summary\n- include `cross_chunk_dynamic_imports` in the devtools\n`ChunkGraphReady` trace\n- add a devtools regression fixture with a real dynamic import\n- assert emitted debug logs contain both module-level and chunk-level\n`dynamic-import` edges\n\n## Verification\n- built the native binding with `tsx build-binding.ts` from\n`packages/rolldown`\n- ran a source-level devtools regression check with\n`NODE_OPTIONS=--conditions=dev` and confirmed\n`{\"hasDynamicModuleImport\":true,\"hasDynamicChunkImport\":true}`","tree":{"sha":"263eafb3cab23600fa681ab90e66b2f9cc877e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/263eafb3cab23600fa681ab90e66b2f9cc877e84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/ad91f3d207d2b034c89919b60c4d9bc8518c816c","verification":{"payload":"tree 263eafb3cab23600fa681ab90e66b2f9cc877e84\nparent 8ace1b8d40dd32f7737807e4f19b50f0cf13476c\nauthor Barry <53959224+cal-gooo@users.noreply.github.com> 1772946864 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772946864 +0000\n\nfix(devtools): trace dynamic imports in devtools (#8581)\n\nFixes #8549.\n\n## Summary\n- include `cross_chunk_dynamic_imports` in the devtools\n`ChunkGraphReady` trace\n- add a devtools regression fixture with a real dynamic import\n- assert emitted debug logs contain both module-level and chunk-level\n`dynamic-import` edges\n\n## Verification\n- built the native binding with `tsx build-binding.ts` from\n`packages/rolldown`\n- ran a source-level devtools regression check with\n`NODE_OPTIONS=--conditions=dev` and confirmed\n`{\"hasDynamicModuleImport\":true,\"hasDynamicChunkImport\":true}`","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJprQWwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9rgQAFBy6Hc6XAKlhOCbGrMrqJOC\niFRTADZ6heGW9z8RWpQo