"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/ec246ba4cc83139df90be3abde61780016c68a52","node_id":"C_kwDOQreA_9oAKGVjMjQ2YmE0Y2M4MzEzOWRmOTBiZTNhYmRlNjE3ODAwMTZjNjhhNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/cb29a71d3a1fc9f18932c9fe31e5118648bdb19c","sha":"cb29a71d3a1fc9f18932c9fe31e5118648bdb19c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/cb29a71d3a1fc9f18932c9fe31e5118648bdb19c"}],"sha":"ec246ba4cc83139df90be3abde61780016c68a52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/ec246ba4cc83139df90be3abde61780016c68a52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/258783736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hyfdev-agent","id":258783736,"login":"hyfdev-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOD2y5-A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hyfdev-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/cb29a71d3a1fc9f18932c9fe31e5118648bdb19c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T07:17:23Z","email":"ada.20260202@outlook.com","name":"hyf0-agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T07:17:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(hmr): fix infinite loop in dev server test retry logic (#8576)\n\n## Summary\n\nFix an infinite loop bug in the dev server fixture test retry mechanism.\n\nThe retry directory naming used a fixed `-retry` suffix:\n```js\nwhile (await isDirectoryExists(tmpProjectPath)) {\n  tmpProjectPath = nodePath.join(tmpFixturesPath, fixtureName + ''-retry'');\n}\n```\n\nWhen both the original directory and `-retry` directory existed (after 2\nfailed attempts), the while loop would repeatedly resolve to the same\nexisting path → infinite loop → test times out at 90s.\n\nThis made vitest''s `retry: 3` config effectively useless beyond the\nfirst retry attempt.\n\n### Fix\n\nUse an incrementing counter: `${fixtureName}-retry-${retryIndex}`\n\nCo-authored-by: hyf0-agent <258783736+hyf0-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Yunfei He <i.heyunfei@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"e380c76dc5fe139bb26ea8015ae53953d83bf3d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/e380c76dc5fe139bb26ea8015ae53953d83bf3d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/cb29a71d3a1fc9f18932c9fe31e5118648bdb19c","verification":{"payload":"tree e380c76dc5fe139bb26ea8015ae53953d83bf3d3\nparent 6e4180030ceaa74bc2c68de760e73d50157772d0\nauthor hyf0-agent <ada.20260202@outlook.com> 1772867843 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772867843 +0000\n\ntest(hmr): fix infinite loop in dev server test retry logic (#8576)\n\n## Summary\n\nFix an infinite loop bug in the dev server fixture test retry mechanism.\n\nThe retry directory naming used a fixed `-retry` suffix:\n```js\nwhile (await isDirectoryExists(tmpProjectPath)) {\n  tmpProjectPath = nodePath.join(tmpFixturesPath, fixtureName + ''-retry'');\n}\n```\n\nWhen both the original directory and `-retry` directory existed (after 2\nfailed attempts), the while loop would repeatedly resolve to the same\nexisting path → infinite loop → test times out at 90s.\n\nThis made vitest''s `retry: 3` config effectively useless beyond the\nfirst retry attempt.\n\n### Fix\n\nUse an incrementing counter: `${fixtureName}-retry-${retryIndex}`\n\nCo-authored-by: hyf0-agent <258783736+hyf0-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Yunfei He <i.heyunfei@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpq9EDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALqEQAIb/rqvhYYNSgEo4IYfSw15+\nvYFglAJUgJs8OFnBZtUkwwiPSwzIZcyp8TxzCGDOZslNjOkvTOzpaRWZKTlEafGS\n4cAQNs6gE5almHxXbARkKq/MYI4fqJ2VniV1m2QXmy/NiITHOiyQueos+HePQMuD\nS53Ui4uCg7YQ1zPKXQQrGHcRS22+gVCb8Zk2kcwJJWMwDmqdadzbq5hs3AwYzBwO\nUoYSB/ZstkS9twWIwhoMtsZf5xe8N54iJvTLWV3SzYwoMPCGwFHA6W243PuWllJt\n12LQOJPNWTCegato9f0UcevXna6RtCLdYeufi3/ZN0zm2hb+ne4Eq6dOIGvv9cgG\nEqMhplelT+tAz5KIxufGBpyirqIGc0ua1J2Th/+9WdHcKphz2QsasFPrSU2vXX8o\nu1dcZZrk7u8Pz0pGID0X0B8xvRBrOFA7xZBqrxTuo/h3dsvoubk0o9JxREW3+Yvg\nYZzOYGnjExSS1QuCBeIadXhClwJ0cotFoxlAy1Q5mg8JpiXDSyh8MUCFMiW9Y9NB\no28P3kp5LXxuArDtvqKM0VqHaIIgkbkPm5maQDBt2d1Q967Fh612iqQ1TbfA1ynz\nMHMH6EJ5ufxzW11T2mLu190P1WPiEgeo9QIVdWkpokv4L284EGtHjrJw5Ih17ORn\nrII07BrO7HjQQDIRZk0w\n=Kbw/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-10T07:34:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/cb29a71d3a1fc9f18932c9fe31e5118648bdb19c","node_id":"C_kwDOQreA_9oAKGNiMjlhNzFkM2ExZmM5ZjE4OTMyYzlmZTMxZTUxMTg2NDhiZGIxOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commit/6e4180030ceaa74bc2c68de760e73d50157772d0","sha":"6e4180030ceaa74bc2c68de760e73d50157772d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/6e4180030ceaa74bc2c68de760e73d50157772d0"}],"sha":"cb29a71d3a1fc9f18932c9fe31e5118648bdb19c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/cb29a71d3a1fc9f18932c9fe31e5118648bdb19c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10465670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-a-n-a/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-a-n-a/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-a-n-a/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-a-n-a/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/h-a-n-a","id":10465670,"login":"h-a-n-a","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDY1Njcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-a-n-a/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-a-n-a/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-a-n-a/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-a-n-a/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-a-n-a/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h-a-n-a","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/6e4180030ceaa74bc2c68de760e73d50157772d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T06:58:15Z","email":"10465670+h-a-n-a@users.noreply.github.com","name":"h-a-n-a"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T06:58:15Z","email":"10465670+h-a-n-a@users.noreply.github.com","name":"h-a-n-a"},"message":"refactor(cli): migrate CLI to CAC (#8551)\n\n## Summary\n\nReplace Node.js''s built-in `parseArgs` with [cac](https://github.com/cacjs/cac) for CLI argument parsing.\n\n**Fixes:** #8410 (camelCase options like `--moduleTypes` silently ignored), #3248 (`-s inline` position restriction), #8523 (`--help` precedence over other options)\n\n## Changes\n\n- Rewrite `cli/arguments/index.ts` — replace `parseArgs` + 16 hand-rolled workarounds with cac setup and a focused post-processing pipeline\n- Simplify `cli/arguments/alias.ts` — remove dead `default` field\n- Simplify `cli/arguments/utils.ts` — remove `kebabCaseToCamelCase` (cac handles this)\n- Add CLI e2e tests for `--help` precedence (#8523), camelCase options (#8410), config override, `-c -w` interaction, and more\n- Add `meta/design/cli.md` documenting the CLI architecture\n\n## What cac gives us\n\n- camelCase/kebab-case interchangeable matching (`--moduleTypes` and `--module-types` both work)\n- `--no-*` negation, `<required>`/`[optional]` value validation, dot-notation nesting, short flag stacking\n- ~130 lines removed, 10 of 16 workarounds eliminated\n\n## Related issues\n\nfixes #8410\nfixes #3248\nfixes #8523\nfixes [#8524](https://github.com/rolldown/rolldown/issues/8524)","tree":{"sha":"20efdd5e1b8a1e1b45cd12e5f3aa2d813f3f1a49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/20efdd5e1b8a1e1b45cd12e5f3aa2d813f3f1a49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/6e4180030ceaa74bc2c68de760e73d50157772d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.