":1430279,"login":"Boshen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzAyNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Boshen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/commits/468a4b3ed6c39bc7879441260718aeb3c39784e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T05:53:47Z","email":"boshenc@gmail.com","name":"Boshen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T05:53:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: skip redundant native binding build for browser and remove standalone job (#8573)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Remove the standalone `build-browser` CI job (234s) which is fully\nredundant — `node-validation` already builds and validates\n`@rolldown/browser` with publint/knip\n- Remove `binding|` from browser build scripts\n(`build-browser-pkg:debug` and `build-browser-pkg:release`) to skip the\nunnecessary native Rust binding compilation (~60-90s), since the `.node`\nfile is marked as `external` and never bundled\n\n> **Note:** After merge, remove `Build @rolldown/browser` from GitHub\nrequired status checks.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d822b373013253929ff69383dc52fd838f159e2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/trees/d822b373013253929ff69383dc52fd838f159e2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shulaoda/rolldown-with-module-federation-2.0/git/commits/468a4b3ed6c39bc7879441260718aeb3c39784e5","verification":{"payload":"tree d822b373013253929ff69383dc52fd838f15